{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WrZHzKrZ5M4KYN58FN58tS","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'D095 framing 完全成立。三层贡献均 land：(1) 系统性 token-level 框架在 3 arch ×\n2\t  4 suite 上验证，\n3\t\n4\t  (2) R² exit collapse + CF sensitivity 作为 architecture-independent training signatures（9/10\n5\t  cells 确认），\n6\t\n7\t  (3) 三层级路由梯度（VLM base→OXE-VLA→task-VLA）作为 genuine new finding。\n8\t\n9\t\n10\t  RUNNING 的 OpenVLA Goal/Spatial 实验完成后矩阵扩展为 10 cells full data。两个新 cell 均确认\n11\t\n12\t  exit collapse（trained Δ > 0.08），mean_trained_exit_delta 落入 ~0.23。OFT outlier 被 framed\n13\t\n14\t  为 parameter-efficient finetuning 特例（D091 已证 TracVLA Long trained L1=30/32 排除任务复杂度解释）。\n15\t\n16\t\n17\t  D090 区分作为科学严谨性体现：论文主动区分 training-induced effects（R² exit collapse, CF\n18\t\n19\t  sensitivity — 三架构一致）与 base-model-dependent effects（L1 head count — 取决于 VLM/LLM\n20\t\n21\t  预训练模式）。这预先回应 reviewer concern \"是否只看预训练效果\"。\n22\t\n23\t\n24\t  三层级路由梯度是叙事升级的关键：从 \"training creates routing\" 升级为 \"routing emerges at\n25\t\n26\t  VLM→VLA transition and reshapes at general→task-specific transition\"。OpenVLA untrained\n27\t\n28\t  (OXE pretrained) 在 Goal/Spatial 上的数据直接支撑 Tier 2（通用 routing 已建立，无 exit collapse），\n29\t\n30\t  与 Tier 3 task-finetuned（exit collapse + task-specific CF）形成对比。\n31\t\n32\t\n33\t  Abstract/claims 保持 D095 强度，标题 \"architecture-independent routing reorganization\"\n34\t  不变。\n35\t\n36\t  C3 保持 qualified observation，不影响 accept/reject，但增加论文分析深度。\n37\t\n38\t  预期 reviewer avg score 5.5-7.0，accept probability 55-75%。\n39\t\n40\t  '\n41\timagined_experiments:\n42\t- name: SigLIP+Projector RSA vs Full VLA vs DINO\n43\t  plan_id: plan_001\n44\t  description: 证明 action-relevant 几何结构源自 frozen vision encoder，LLM 处理反而降低 RSA\n45\t  expected_results:\n46\t    siglip_projector_rsa: 0.615\n47\t    bootstrap_95_ci:\n48\t    - 0.526\n49\t    - 0.695\n50\t    trained_vla_peak_rsa: 0.488\n51\t    untrained_vla_peak_rsa: 0.485\n52\t    dino_rsa: 0.388\n53\t    llm_degradation_magnitude: 0.127\n54\t    ordering: SigLIP+Proj (0.615) >> VLA trained (0.488) ≈ VLA untrained (0.485) >>\n55\t      DINO (0.388)\n56\t  result_rationale: 'Frozen SigLIP+projector 保留最强 action-aligned geometry（RSA=0.615）。LLM\n57\t    各层将表征\n58\t\n59\t    从视觉对齐空间转换到语言/动作解码空间，RSA 降至 ~0.488（降幅 20.7%）。关键发现是\n60\t\n61\t    trained ≈ untrained（Δ=0.003），证明 RSA 测量的几何结构由 frozen encoder 决定，\n62\t\n63\t    LLM 训练不改善这一度量。DINO 虽是强 self-supervised baseline（0.388），但缺乏\n64\t\n65\t    vision-language alignment 导致 RSA 显著低于 SigLIP。这一层级为 C3（encoder geometry\n66\t\n67\t    observation）奠定基础，同时排除了 \"训练改善表征几何\" 的错误 narrative。\n68\t\n69\t    '\n70\t  tables:\n71\t  - title: Encoder-to-VLA RSA Comparison\n72\t    columns:\n73\t    - Source\n74\t    - RSA ρ\n75\t    - 95% CI\n76\t    - vs DINO Δ\n77\t    rows:\n78\t    - - SigLIP+Proj\n79\t      - '0.615'\n80\t      - '[0.526, 0.695]'\n81\t      - '+0.227'\n82\t    - - VLA Trained Peak\n83\t      - '0.488'\n84\t      - —\n85\t      - '+0.100'\n86\t    - - VLA Untrained Peak\n87\t      - '0.485'\n88\t      - —\n89\t      - '+0.097'\n90\t    - - DINO cls_token\n91\t      - '0.388'\n92\t      - —\n93\t      - baseline\n94\t  figures_description:\n95\t  - 'Bar chart: 4 sources (SigLIP, VLA trained, VLA untrained, DINO) RSA 值 with error\n96\t    bars'\n97\t  analysis: 'SigLIP >> VLA >> DINO 层级确立。LLM 是 action-relevant geometry 的消费者而非增强者。\n98\t\n99\t    为 C1 framework 提供定量基础：frozen encoder 是结构源头。\n100\t\n101\t    '\n102\t- name: DINO Baseline RSA\n103\t  plan_id: plan_002\n104\t  description: Standalone DINOv2 作为 vision-only baseline，建立 encoder quality 下界\n105\t  expected_results:\n106\t    temporal_distance_rho_pooled: 0.833\n107\t    per_task_rho_mean: 0.901\n108\t    R2_action_probe: 0.687\n109\t    subtask_macro_auc: 0.972\n110\t    control_b_permutation_rho: 0.039\n111\t  result_rationale: 'DINOv2 cls_token 在纯视觉层面已捕获强时序/动作结构（per-task ρ=0.901，R²=0.687），\n112\t\n113\t    证明 self-supervised per-patch objective 创建了与 robot action 对齐的表征。但 RSA=0.388\n114\t\n115\t    低于 SigLIP(0.615)，说明 vision-language 对齐提供额外增益。Label permutation control\n116\t\n117\t    （ρ=0.039）排除 probe 过拟合。DINOv2 作为 cross-encoder 比较的锚点：任何 VLA encoder\n118\t\n119\t    component 的 RSA 必须 >> 0.388 才有意义。\n120\t\n121\t    '\n122\t  tables: []\n123\t  figures_description:\n124\t  - DINOv2 per-task ρ 分布 boxplot，显示 cross-task variance\n125\t  analysis: 建立 vision-only floor。DINOv2 R²=0.687 与 VLA best layer 可比，但 RSA 差距大。\n126\t- name: Per-layer RSA Degradation Curve\n127\t  plan_id: plan_003\n128\t  description: 追踪 RSA 从 projector output 到 LLM 各层的变换轨迹，揭示训练如何重塑 layer-wise geometry\n129\t  expected_results:\n130\t    trained_image_mean_pattern: inverted-U\n131\t    trained_image_mean_peak_layer: 12\n132\t    trained_image_mean_peak_rsa: 0.628\n133\t    trained_image_mean_L0_rsa: 0.612\n134\t    trained_image_mean_L32_rsa: 0.422\n135\t    untrained_pattern: monotonic_decay\n136\t    untrained_peak_layer: 0\n137\t    untrained_L0_rsa: 0.612\n138\t    untrained_L32_rsa: 0.545\n139\t    projector_to_L1_drop: 0.13-0.25\n140\t  result_rationale: '训练创造 RSA inverted-U：中层（L12）达到峰值 0.628，说明训练使 LLM 中层成为 action-relevant\n141\t\n142\t    信息整合的场所。Exit 层 RSA 急剧下降至 0.422，反映出口层专注于 action decoding 而非\n143\t\n144\t    保持 geometric alignment。Untrained 模型无此组织——单调衰减说明 random LLM weights\n145\t\n146\t    只是逐层损耗 encoder 传来的结构。两条件在 L0 起点一致（0.612）因为共享 frozen projector\n147\t\n148\t    output。Proj→L1 是最大跳变（20-40% drop），对应 embedding layer 的维度转换。\n149\t\n150\t    '\n151\t  tables:\n152\t  - title: Per-layer RSA Profile Summary\n153\t    columns:\n154\t    - Condition\n155\t    - L0\n156\t    - Peak Layer\n157\t    - Peak RSA\n158\t    - L32\n159\t    - Δ(peak-exit)\n160\t    rows:\n161\t    - - Trained img_mean\n162\t      - '0.612'\n163\t      - L12\n164\t      - '0.628'\n165\t      - '0.422'\n166\t      - '0.206'\n167\t    - - Untrained img_mean\n168\t      - '0.612'\n169\t      - L0\n170\t      - '0.612'\n171\t      - '0.545'\n172\t      - '0.067'\n173\t  figures_description:\n174\t  - 双线折线图：trained（红）vs untrained（蓝）RSA across 33 layers，标注 peak + exit\n175\t  analysis: 训练 shifts RSA peak 从 L0→L12，创造 inverted-U。C3 observation 的核心证据。\n176\t- name: Output Head Weight Analysis\n177\t  plan_id: plan_004\n178\t  description: 确认 SigLIP+projector frozen，LLM 权重变化均匀分布，排除 shallow adaptation\n179\t  expected_results:\n180\t    vision_cos_sim: 1.0\n181\t    projector_cos_sim: 1.001\n182\t    llm_mean_rel_change: 1.316\n183\t    llm_rel_change_range:\n184\t    - 1.22\n185\t    - 1.37\n186\t    head_vs_llm_ratio: 1.12\n187\t    shallow_adaptation_gate: FAIL (1.12x < 3x threshold)\n188\t  result_rationale: 'Vision + projector 完全冻结（cos_sim=1.0），确认 C1 的结构基础。LLM 32 层权重变化\n189\t\n190\t    均匀分布（rel_change 1.22-1.37），output head 并非特殊（ratio 1.12x）。排除了\n191\t\n192\t    \"训练只修改最后几层\" 的 shallow adaptation 假设。这解释了为什么 trained ≈ untrained\n193\t\n194\t    在 RSA/R² 上——共享的 frozen components 主导表征结构。注意 untrained 这里是 random init\n195\t\n196\t    vs pretrained Llama，差异主要由预训练 vs 随机决定。\n197\t\n198\t    '\n199\t  tables: []\n200\t  figures_description:\n201\t  - 'Per-component rel_change bar chart: vision(0) | projector(0) | llm_layers(uniform\n202\t    ~1.3) | head(1.48)'\n203\t  analysis: Frozen encoder 解释了 trained ≈ untrained RSA 收敛。LLM 训练是全局重塑而非局部适配。\n204\t- name: 6 Probing Methods × 2 Benchmarks Systematic Validation\n205\t  plan_id: plan_005\n206\t  description: 多方法多 benchmark 系统验证 trained ≈ untrained >> DINO\n207\t  expected_results:\n208\t    consistency: All 6 methods agree\n209\t    ordering: trained ≈ untrained >> DINO\n210\t    trained_best_rho: 0.955\n211\t    untrained_best_rho: 0.933\n212\t    dino_rho: 0.901\n213\t    action_probe_trained_best_R2: 0.683\n214\t    action_probe_untrained_best_R2: 0.617\n215\t  result_rationale: '六种独立方法（temporal ρ, action probe R², delta probe, RSA, CKA, classification）在两个\n216\t\n217\t    benchmark 上一致显示 trained ≈ untrained >> DINO。方法间一致性排除了单一度量偏见。\n218\t\n219\t    Trained 与 untrained 的差距小（Δρ=0.022, ΔR²=0.066）但 VLA >> DINO 差距大（Δρ=0.054）。\n220\t\n221\t    这确立了核心 narrative：architecture matters（VLA >> DINO），training effect 在表征层面\n222\t\n223\t    有限但可测量。训练效应主要体现在 routing（C2）而非 geometry（C3）。\n224\t\n225\t    '\n226\t  tables: []\n227\t  figures_description:\n228\t  - 'Heatmap: 6 methods × 3 conditions (trained/untrained/dino) 的 normalized scores'\n229\t  analysis: 多方法一致性是论文方法论贡献的关键证据，支撑 C1 framework 的 reusable value。\n230\t- name: Instruction Ablation\n231\t  plan_id: plan_006\n232\t  description: 去掉 instruction text 测 RSA 变化，验证 action-relevant structure 是 vision-driven\n233\t  expected_results:\n234\t    delta_with_minus_no_inst: 0.004\n235\t    gate_threshold: 0.1\n236\t    gate_judgment: FAIL — vision-driven, not instruction-driven\n237\t    no_inst_untrained_peak_rsa: 0.48\n238\t    with_inst_trained_peak_rsa: 0.488\n239\t  result_rationale: '去掉 instruction 后 RSA 几乎不变（Δ=0.004 << 0.10 threshold），确认 RSA 测量的是\n240\t\n241\t    视觉对齐几何结构。Instruction tokens 通过 causal mask 不影响 image tokens，而 RSA\n242\t\n243\t    主要依赖 image-dominant 的时序结构。这排除了 \"instruction routing 改善 geometric\n244\t\n245\t    alignment\" 的可能解释，将 instruction 效应限定在 routing（C2 attention/probe 级别）\n246\t\n247\t    而非 geometry（C3 RSA 级别）。与 plan_008 的 instruction content invariance 共同\n248\t\n249\t    构成 triple invariance 证据。\n250\t\n251\t    '\n252\t  tables: []\n253\t  figures_description: []\n254\t  analysis: Instruction 不影响 RSA。训练效应在 routing 而非 geometry 层面。\n255\t- name: 2×2 Training × Instruction Matrix\n256\t  plan_id: plan_007\n257\t  description: 四条件全收敛，同时排除 training 和 instruction 对 RSA 的影响\n258\t  expected_results:\n259\t    trained_with_inst: 0.488\n260\t    trained_no_inst: 0.489\n261\t    untrained_with_inst: 0.485\n262\t    untrained_no_inst: 0.48\n263\t    bootstrap_delta_ci: '[-0.058, 0.072] includes 0'\n264\t    convergence_band: 0.48-0.49\n265\t  result_rationale: '四条件在 0.48-0.49 带内收敛，Bootstrap CI 包含 0。Training effect（Δ=0.003-0.009）\n266\t\n267\t    和 instruction effect（Δ=0.001-0.004）均不显著。这是最直接的 null result evidence：\n268\t\n269\t    RSA 对 training 和 instruction 双重不变。Frozen encoder output（0.615）进入 LLM 后\n270\t\n271\t    被降级到 ~0.488，这一降级对 training/instruction 条件不敏感。2×2 factorial design\n272\t\n273\t    排除了交互效应。\n274\t\n275\t    '\n276\t  tables:\n277\t  - title: 2×2 RSA Convergence Matrix\n278\t    columns:\n279\t    - ''\n280\t    - With Instruction\n281\t    - No Instruction\n282\t    - Instruction Effect\n283\t    rows:\n284\t    - - Trained\n285\t      - '0.488'\n286\t      - '0.489'\n287\t      - '-0.001'\n288\t    - - Untrained\n289\t      - '0.485'\n290\t      - '0.480'\n291\t      - '+0.004'\n292\t    - - Training Effect\n293\t      - '+0.003'\n294\t      - '+0.009'\n295\t      - ''\n296\t  figures_description: []\n297\t  analysis: 双因素不变性确立。RSA 由 frozen encoder 决定，LLM 条件无关。\n298\t- name: Random Instruction Control\n299\t  plan_id: plan_008\n300\t  description: 三重不变性完备：正常/随机/打乱/空白 instruction 均不影响 RSA\n301\t  expected_results:\n302\t    normal_peak_rsa: 0.489\n303\t    random_peak_rsa: 0.484\n304\t    shuffled_peak_rsa: 0.483\n305\t    empty_peak_rsa: 0.472\n306\t    max_absolute_delta: 0.017\n307\t    instruction_invariant: true\n308\t  result_rationale: '四种 instruction 条件（正常、随机词、打乱、空白）的 RSA 在 ±0.017 内收敛。\n309\t\n310\t    最大偏差来自 empty（0.472 vs normal 0.489），但 Δ=0.017 远小于 meaningful effect。\n311\t\n312\t    三重不变性（training × instruction presence × instruction content）完备：\n313\t\n314\t    RSA 不受任何 instruction 维度影响。这排除了 reviewer 可能提出的 \"trivial separability\"\n315\t\n316\t    攻击——即使给模型无意义输入，geometric alignment 也不变。为 C3 observation 提供\n317\t\n318\t    方法论基础：RSA 测量的纯粹是 visual structure。\n319\t\n320\t    '\n321\t  tables: []\n322\t  figures_description: []\n323\t  analysis: Triple invariance 完备。RSA 是 vision-only metric，强化 C3 scope 限定。\n324\t- name: CKA Verification — Metric Robustness Check\n325\t  plan_id: plan_009\n326\t  description: CKA 指标重复 RSA 发现，发现 ordering reversal — metric dissociation 本身是 finding\n327\t  expected_results:\n328\t    cka_ordering: untrained > trained > projector > DINO\n329\t    rsa_ordering: projector > trained ≈ untrained > DINO\n330\t    dino_lowest_both_metrics: true\n331\t    last_preaction_cka_highest: 0.127\n332\t    dissociation_finding: RSA=geometric alignment (LLM degrades), CKA=global structure\n333\t      (LLM preserves)\n334\t  result_rationale: 'CKA 与 RSA 的 ordering reversal 不是失败而是发现。RSA 测量局部几何对齐（LLM 降低），\n335\t\n336\t    CKA 测量全局结构保持（LLM 维持甚至增强）。这意味着 LLM 训练在保持全局信息结构的\n337\t\n338\t    同时重塑局部几何——与 routing reorganization narrative 一致。DINO 在两个指标下均最低\n339\t\n340\t    是 robust 发现。last_preaction CKA=0.127 >> image_mean CKA=0.089 确认 instruction\n341\t\n342\t    tokens 携带更多全局结构信息。metric dissociation 增强论文深度：C3 需加 \"under RSA\"\n343\t\n344\t    qualifier，但 \"geometric degradation + structural preservation\" 是比单一结果更丰富的故事。\n345\t\n346\t    '\n347\t  tables:\n348\t  - title: RSA vs CKA Ordering Comparison\n349\t    columns:\n350\t    - Source\n351\t    - RSA Rank\n352\t    - Linear CKA Rank\n353\t    - RDM-CKA Rank\n354\t    rows:\n355\t    - - SigLIP+Proj\n356\t      - 1st (0.615)\n357\t      - 3rd (0.081)\n358\t      - 2nd (0.257)\n359\t    - - VLA Trained\n360\t      - 2nd (0.488)\n361\t      - 4th (0.083)\n362\t      - 1st (0.260)\n363\t    - - VLA Untrained\n364\t      - 3rd (0.485)\n365\t      - 2nd (0.089)\n366\t      - 3rd (0.246)\n367\t    - - DINO\n368\t      - 4th (0.388)\n369\t      - 5th (0.066)\n370\t      - 4th (0.241)\n371\t  figures_description:\n372\t  - 'Paired bar chart: RSA vs CKA rankings side-by-side，标注 ordering reversal'\n373\t  analysis: Metric dissociation 本身是 finding。C3 加 qualifier，但 story 变得更丰富。\n374\t- name: LIBERO-Spatial Cross-Benchmark Validation\n375\t  plan_id: plan_010\n376\t  description: 第二 benchmark 交叉验证：LIBERO-Spatial 上复现 inverted-U 和 trained > untrained\n377\t  expected_results:\n378\t    trained_image_mean_peak_layer: 13\n379\t    trained_image_mean_peak_R2: 0.696\n380\t    trained_last_preaction_peak_layer: 21\n381\t    trained_last_preaction_peak_R2: 0.675\n382\t    untrained_image_mean_peak_layer: 0\n383\t    untrained_image_mean_peak_R2: 0.673\n384\t    untrained_last_preaction_peak_layer: 1\n385\t    untrained_last_preaction_peak_R2: 0.635\n386\t    bootstrap_best_vs_best_p: 0.001\n387\t    rsa_trained_peak_layer: 14\n388\t    rsa_trained_peak_rsa: 0.691\n389\t    rsa_untrained_peak_layer: 0\n390\t    rsa_untrained_peak_rsa: 0.652\n391\t  result_rationale: 'Spatial 任务复现 Goal 的核心 pattern：(1) R² inverted-U trained peak\n392\t    L13-L21（vs Goal\n393\t\n394\t    L8-L13），(2) trained > untrained 在 best-vs-best 显著（p<0.001），(3) untrained\n395\t\n396\t    deep-layer collapse（L5-L31 R²≈-0.015，仅 L32 恢复）。Peak layer 向后移动 2-8 层\n397\t\n398\t    可能反映 spatial reasoning 需要更深层 processing。RSA 同样显示 trained inverted-U\n399\t\n400\t    （peak L14-15，RSA≈0.69）。Cross-benchmark consistency 高（peak layer 偏移在 2 层\n401\t\n402\t    以内），排除 suite-specific artifact。\n403\t\n404\t    '\n405\t  tables:\n406\t  - title: Cross-Benchmark R² Peak Comparison\n407\t    columns:\n408\t    - Benchmark\n409\t    - Trained img_mean Peak\n410\t    - Trained lastpre Peak\n411\t    - Consistency\n412\t    rows:\n413\t    - - LIBERO-Goal\n414\t      - L8 (0.655)\n415\t      - L13 (0.678)\n416\t      - —\n417\t    - - LIBERO-Spatial\n418\t      - L13 (0.696)\n419\t      - L21 (0.675)\n420\t      - peak +5/+8 layers\n421\t  figures_description:\n422\t  - 双 benchmark R² profile overlay：Goal（实线）vs Spatial（虚线）\n423\t  analysis: Cross-benchmark 复现成功。Peak layer 偏移在可接受范围内。C1 framework validated。\n424\t- name: Full-layer R² Scan (33 layers × 2 conditions × 2 aggregations)\n425\t  plan_id: plan_011\n426\t  description: 132 probes 验证 R² per-layer curve 与 RSA inverted-U 一致，建立 exit collapse\n427\t    证据\n428\t  expected_results:\n429\t    trained_image_mean_peak:\n430\t      layer: 8\n431\t      R2: 0.655\n432\t    trained_last_preaction_peak:\n433\t      layer: 13\n434\t      R2: 0.678\n435\t    untrained_image_mean_peak:\n436\t      layer: 0\n437\t      R2: 0.64\n438\t    untrained_last_preaction_peak:\n439\t      layer: 32\n440\t      R2: 0.609\n441\t    bootstrap_best_vs_best_image_mean:\n442\t      delta: 0.015\n443\t      p: 0.006\n444\t    bootstrap_best_vs_best_last_preaction:\n445\t      delta: 0.069\n446\t      p: 0.0001\n447\t    rsa_r2_peak_alignment_trained_lastpre: RSA L12, R² L13 — 1-layer offset\n448\t    untrained_pathological_layers: L10-L13 R² ≈ 0 (random init collapsed)\n449\t  result_rationale: 'R² 独立确认 RSA inverted-U pattern。Trained last_preaction peak L13（R²=0.678）与\n450\t\n451\t    RSA peak L12 仅 1 层偏移，说明 geometric alignment 和 functional decodability 在训练后\n452\t\n453\t    近乎对齐。Untrained 的 L10-L13 pathological collapse（R²≈0, 甚至 -0.33）是 random init\n454\t\n455\t    LLM 在深层创造不可解码表征的证据——这是训练 restructures representations 的最直观\n456\t\n457\t    证据。best-vs-best 比较：image_mean Δ=0.015（p=0.006, marginal），last_preaction\n458\t\n459\t    Δ=0.069（p<0.0001, highly significant）。last_preaction 从 untrained L32 peak 到\n460\t\n461\t    trained L13 peak 的迁移是 training-induced routing reorganization 的 R² 层面证据。\n462\t\n463\t    这组数据是 C2 exit collapse claim 在 OpenVLA 单架构上的基础。\n464\t\n465\t    '\n466\t  tables:\n467\t  - title: R² Peak Summary (OpenVLA on LIBERO-Goal)\n468\t    columns:\n469\t    - Condition\n470\t    - Readout\n471\t    - Peak Layer\n472\t    - Peak R²\n473\t    - Exit R²\n474\t    - Δ\n475\t    rows:\n476\t    - - Trained\n477\t      - image_mean\n478\t      - L8\n479\t      - '0.655'\n480\t      - ~0.45\n481\t      - ~0.20\n482\t    - - Trained\n483\t      - last_preaction\n484\t      - L13\n485\t      - '0.678'\n486\t      - ~0.55\n487\t      - ~0.13\n488\t    - - Untrained\n489\t      - image_mean\n490\t      - L0\n491\t      - '0.640'\n492\t      - ~0.35\n493\t      - ~0.29\n494\t    - - Untrained\n495\t      - last_preaction\n496\t      - L32\n497\t      - '0.609'\n498\t      - —\n499\t      - baseline\n500\t  figures_description:\n501\t  - 4-panel per-layer R² curve：trained/untrained × image_mean/last_preaction，标注 peak\n502\t    + pathological zones\n503\t  analysis: R² 确认 RSA inverted-U。Exit collapse + pathological layers = training restructuring\n504\t    核心证据。\n505\t- name: CLIP-ViT Pretraining Control\n506\t  plan_id: plan_012\n507\t  description: CLIP ViT-L 替代 SigLIP，区分 vision-language pretraining 贡献 vs encoder quality\n508\t  expected_results:\n509\t    clip_cls_rsa: 0.557\n510\t    clip_cls_R2: 0.587\n511\t    dino_cls_rsa: 0.631\n512\t    dino_cls_R2: 0.634\n513\t    projector_R2: 0.63\n514\t    ordering: VLA last_pre (0.671) > DINO (0.634) ≈ Projector (0.630) > VLA img_mean\n515\t      (0.599) > CLIP (0.587)\n516\t    clip_lt_dino_both: true\n517\t  result_rationale: 'CLIP < DINO 在 RSA（0.557 vs 0.631）和 R²（0.587 vs 0.634）两个维度。这推翻了\n518\t\n519\t    \"vision-language pretraining 优于 self-supervised\" 的直觉。DINOv2 的 per-patch\n520\t\n521\t    self-supervised objective 创造了更丰富的空间表征，与 robot action 结构更对齐。\n522\t\n523\t    CLIP 的 contrastive learning 优化 global image-text matching，不保留 fine-grained\n524\t\n525\t    spatial/temporal 信息。这为 C3 cross-encoder ranking 提供定量基础：在 RSA metric 下\n526\t\n527\t    DINOv2 >> CLIP >> baseline。论文可 claim \"self-supervised spatial features provide\n528\t\n529\t    stronger action-aligned geometry than vision-language contrastive features\"。\n530\t\n531\t    '\n532\t  tables:\n533\t  - title: Cross-Encoder Unified Comparison\n534\t    columns:\n535\t    - Encoder\n536\t    - RSA\n537\t    - R² (action)\n538\t    - Ranking\n539\t    rows:\n540\t    - - DINOv2 cls\n541\t      - 0.692/0.631\n542\t      - '0.634'\n543\t      - 1st / 2nd\n544\t    - - SigLIP+Proj\n545\t      - '0.615'\n546\t      - '0.630'\n547\t      - 2nd / 3rd\n548\t    - - CLIP ViT-L\n549\t      - '0.557'\n550\t      - '0.587'\n551\t      - 4th / 5th\n552\t  figures_description:\n553\t  - 'Scatter plot: RSA vs R² for all encoder sources'\n554\t  analysis: VL pretraining 不优于 self-supervised。DINOv2 spatial objective 更适合 action\n555\t    alignment。\n556\t- name: Branch-Split RSA (DINOv2 vs SigLIP within Fused Backbone)\n557\t  plan_id: plan_013\n558\t  description: 分离 fused backbone 的两个 branch，定量回答各组件对 action geometry 的贡献\n559\t  expected_results:\n560\t    dinov2_branch_rsa: 0.619\n561\t    siglip_branch_rsa: 0.621\n562\t    fused_2176d_rsa: 0.634\n563\t    post_projector_4096d_rsa: 0.615\n564\t    standalone_dino_cls_rsa: 0.692\n565\t    branch_delta: 0.002\n566\t    fusion_benefit: 0.015\n567\t    projector_compression_loss: 0.019\n568\t  result_rationale: 'Fused backbone 中 DINOv2 branch（0.619）≈ SigLIP branch（0.621），两者贡献均等。\n569\t\n570\t    Fusion > either branch（0.634 vs 0.619/0.621），证明两 branch 提供互补信息。\n571\t\n572\t    Projector 将 2176d fused → 4096d（然后 projection），RSA 从 0.634→0.615（损失 0.019），\n573\t\n574\t    说明降维有信息损耗。Standalone DINOv2 cls（0.692）高于 in-backbone DINOv2（0.619），\n575\t\n576\t    因为提取层不同（standalone 用 cls_token 最终层，in-backbone 经过 fusion averaging）。\n577\t\n578\t    论文结论：两个 vision backbone branch 同等重要，fusion 有互补增益，projector 有微小损耗。\n579\t\n580\t    '\n581\t  tables:\n582\t  - title: Branch-Split RSA Decomposition\n583\t    columns:\n584\t    - Component\n585\t    - RSA\n586\t    - Note\n587\t    rows:\n588\t    - - DINOv2 branch (1088d)\n589\t      - '0.619'\n590\t      - in-backbone\n591\t    - - SigLIP branch (1088d)\n592\t      - '0.621'\n593\t      - in-backbone\n594\t    - - Fused (2176d)\n595\t      - '0.634'\n596\t      - complementary gain\n597\t    - - Post-projector (4096d)\n598\t      - '0.615'\n599\t      - compression loss -0.019\n600\t  figures_description:\n601\t  - 'Stacked bar: branch contributions + fusion gain + projector loss'\n602\t  analysis: Equal branch contribution + complementary fusion。Projector compression\n603\t    是 RSA 降级的一个源头。\n604\t- name: OpenVLA Goal Standardized Full Pipeline\n605\t  plan_id: openvla_goal_standardized_v1\n606\t  description: 'OpenVLA (Llama-2-7B) 在 LIBERO-Goal 的标准化 5-phase pipeline。\n607\t\n608\t    Trained = openvla-7b-finetuned-libero-goal，Untrained = openvla-7b (OXE pretrained,\n609\t    970K episodes)。\n610\t\n611\t    填充 3×4 矩阵的 OpenVLA×Goal cell，提供 trained vs OXE-pretrained 对比。\n612\t\n613\t    '\n614\t  expected_results:\n615\t    trained_r2_image_mean_peak:\n616\t      layer: L9\n617\t      R2: 0.655\n618\t    trained_r2_last_preaction_peak:\n619\t      layer: L13\n620\t      R2: 0.678\n621\t    trained_r2_last_preaction_exit_L31: 0.528\n622\t    trained_exit_collapse_delta: 0.15\n623\t    untrained_r2_image_mean_peak:\n624\t      layer: L12\n625\t      R2: 0.845\n626\t    untrained_r2_image_mean_exit_L31: 0.832\n627\t    untrained_r2_last_preaction_peak:\n628\t      layer: L21\n629\t      R2: 0.825\n630\t    untrained_r2_last_preaction_exit_L31: 0.805\n631\t    untrained_exit_collapse_delta: 0.02\n632\t    trained_L1_instruction_dominant: 24\n633\t    trained_L1_total_heads: 32\n634\t    trained_L1_mean_text_attn: 0.577\n635\t    untrained_L1_instruction_dominant: 25\n636\t    untrained_L1_total_heads: 32\n637\t    untrained_L1_mean_text_attn: 0.62\n638\t    untrained_L1_mixed_heads: 7\n639\t    trained_image_mean_all_layers: 0.1\n640\t    trained_last_preaction_L1: 0.996\n641\t    trained_last_preaction_L2_plus: 1.0\n642\t    untrained_image_mean_all_layers: 0.1\n643\t    untrained_last_preaction_all_layers: 1.0\n644\t    trained_rsa_peak:\n645\t      layer: L12\n646\t      rsa: 0.628\n647\t    trained_rsa_exit_L31: 0.42\n648\t    untrained_rsa_peak:\n649\t      layer: L12\n650\t      rsa: 0.52\n651\t    untrained_rsa_exit_L31: 0.5\n652\t    trained_cf_empty_d: 0.96\n653\t    trained_cf_wrong_d: 0.91\n654\t    trained_cf_shuffled_d: 0.77\n655\t    trained_cf_paraphrased_d: 0.7\n656\t    trained_cf_ordering: empty > wrong > shuffled > paraphrased\n657\t    untrained_cf_empty_d: 1.05\n658\t    untrained_cf_wrong_d: 0.84\n659\t    untrained_cf_shuffled_d: 0.63\n660\t    untrained_cf_paraphrased_d: 0.61\n661\t    untrained_cf_ordering: empty > wrong > shuffled > paraphrased\n662\t  result_rationale: '**R² Exit Collapse (trained Δ=0.150 >> untrained Δ=0.020)**:\n663\t\n664\t    Trained 模型在 exit layers 出现 R² collapse：last_preaction 从 peak L13=0.678 下降到\n665\t\n666\t    L31=0.528（Δ=0.150），确认 exit collapse > 0.08 threshold。这与 OpenVLA Object\n667\t\n668\t    （Δ=0.121）量级一致，Goal suite 稍高因为 goal-conditioned 任务对 instruction routing\n669\t\n670\t    要求更强，exit 层需要更多 capacity 分配给 action conditioning 而非 instruction retention。\n671\t\n672\t\n673\t    Untrained (OXE pretrained) 模型几乎无 exit collapse（Δ=0.020）。OXE 的 970K episodes\n674\t\n675\t    通用训练创建了 flat R² profile（image_mean: 0.83-0.85 全程平坦；last_preaction: 从 0.61\n676\t\n677\t    monotonic rise 到 0.825 后保持），因为通用训练学到的是 general-purpose routing，不需要\n678\t\n679\t    task-specific exit collapse。R² 绝对值高于 trained 模型（0.845 vs 0.655 for image_mean）\n680\t\n681\t    因为 OXE 模型保留了更多 general action information，而 task-specific fine-tuning 牺牲了\n682\t\n683\t    generality 换取 exit-layer task specialization。\n684\t\n685\t\n686\t    **L1 Attention**: Trained 24/32 instruction-dominant 与 CLAUDE.md 既有数据一致。\n687\t\n688\t    OXE pretrained 25/32 instruction-dominant（从 openvla_long_untrained 数据外推），\n689\t\n690\t    表明 L1 routing 是 OXE pretraining 创建的（D090 base-model-dependent）。训练后 L1\n691\t\n692\t    heads 从 25→24（微小下降），说明 task-specific fine-tuning 不增强 L1 routing 而是\n693\t\n694\t    redistribute 部分 head 用于 task-specific computation。\n695\t\n696\t\n697\t    **Cross-Instruction**: Image_mean = chance (10%) 在两条件下不变（causal mask guarantee）。\n698\t\n699\t    Last_preaction trained 从 L1 即 99.6%（即时路由），untrained (OXE) 全层 100%（OXE\n700\t\n701\t    pretraining 已建立强 instruction encoding）。差异在于 untrained 的 \"100%\" 来自通用\n702\t\n703\t    routing，trained 的 \"100%\" 来自 task-specific routing — probe accuracy 饱和无法区分，\n704\t\n705\t    但 R² exit collapse 和 CF 可以。\n706\t\n707\t\n708\t    **RSA**: Trained inverted-U peak L12（0.628）与 plan_003 一致。Untrained (OXE) peak\n709\t\n710\t    也在 L12（0.52），但整体 RSA lower 因为 OXE 模型已部分重塑 geometry。\n711\t\n712\t\n713\t    **Counterfactual**: Trained CF ordering（empty>wrong>shuffled>para）与 10-task 数据\n714\t\n715\t    一致。d 值 0.70-0.96 处于中等-强效应。OXE untrained 也显示强 CF（empty d=1.05），\n716\t\n717\t    这是 D094 三层级梯度的关键证据——Tier 2 (OXE VLA) 已有 CF sensitivity（通用 routing），\n718\t\n719\t    但缺乏 exit collapse（task-specific routing）。Trained vs OXE 的 CF 差异小于 trained\n720\t\n721\t    vs VLM-base 差异，进一步支持 \"routing reshapes at task-specific transition\" 叙事。\n722\t\n723\t    '\n724\t  tables:\n725\t  - title: 'OpenVLA × Goal: R² Exit Collapse'\n726\t    columns:\n727\t    - Condition\n728\t    - R² Peak\n729\t    - Peak Layer\n730\t    - R² Exit (L31)\n731\t    - Δ (peak-exit)\n732\t    - Collapse?\n733\t    rows:\n734\t    - - Trained (LIBERO-finetuned)\n735\t      - '0.678'\n736\t      - L13\n737\t      - '0.528'\n738\t      - '0.150'\n739\t      - Yes (> 0.08)\n740\t    - - Untrained (OXE pretrained)\n741\t      - '0.825'\n742\t      - L21\n743\t      - '0.805'\n744\t      - '0.020'\n745\t      - 'No'\n746\t  - title: 'OpenVLA × Goal: L1 Attention & CF'\n747\t    columns:\n748\t    - Condition\n749\t    - L1 Instr-Dom Heads\n750\t    - Text Attn %\n751\t    - CF empty d\n752\t    - CF ordering\n753\t    rows:\n754\t    - - Trained\n755\t      - 24/32\n756\t      - 57.7%\n757\t      - '0.96'\n758\t      - empty > wrong > shuf > para\n759\t    - - Untrained (OXE)\n760\t      - 25/32\n761\t      - 62.0%\n762\t      - '1.05'\n763\t      - empty > wrong > shuf > para\n764\t  - title: 'Three-Tier Gradient: Goal Suite'\n765\t    columns:\n766\t    - Tier\n767\t    - Model\n768\t    - L1 Heads\n769\t    - CF d (empty)\n770\t    - R² Exit Δ\n771\t    - Exit Collapse?\n772\t    rows:\n773\t    - - Tier 1 (VLM base)\n774\t      - Llama-2-7B random init\n775\t      - 0/32\n776\t      - ~0\n777\t      - N/A (pathological)\n778\t      - N/A\n779\t    - - Tier 2 (OXE VLA)\n780\t      - openvla-7b\n781\t      - 25/32\n782\t      - '1.05'\n783\t      - '0.020'\n784\t      - 'No'\n785\t    - - Tier 3 (Task VLA)\n786\t      - openvla-goal-finetuned\n787\t      - 24/32\n788\t      - '0.96'\n789\t      - '0.150'\n790\t      - 'Yes'\n791\t  figures_description:\n792\t  - 'Per-layer R² profiles: trained（红实线）vs OXE-untrained（蓝虚线），双 readout，标注 exit collapse\n793\t    zone'\n794\t  - 'L1 attention heatmap: 32 heads × 2 conditions，instruction-dominant highlighted'\n795\t  - 'CF sensitivity bar chart: 4 counterfactual conditions × 2 model conditions'\n796\t  analysis: 'OpenVLA Goal cell 确认 exit collapse（Δ=0.150 > 0.08）和三层级梯度。\n797\t\n798\t    OXE pretrained 作为 Tier 2 提供关键对比：已有 L1 routing 和 CF，但无 exit collapse。\n799\t\n800\t    这直接支持 \"routing emerges at VLM→VLA, reshapes at general→task-specific\" 叙事。\n801\t\n802\t    L1 heads 24 vs 25 的微小差异支持 D090：L1 routing 是 base-model-dependent。\n803\t\n804\t    此 cell 加入后 matrix_cells_with_full_data = 9。\n805\t\n806\t    '\n807\t- name: OpenVLA Spatial Standardized Full Pipeline\n808\t  plan_id: openvla_spatial_standardized_v1\n809\t  description: 'OpenVLA (Llama-2-7B) 在 LIBERO-Spatial 的标准化 6-phase pipeline。\n810\t\n811\t    Trained = openvla-7b-finetuned-libero-spatial，Untrained = openvla-7b (OXE pretrained)。\n812\t\n813\t    填充 3×4 矩阵的 OpenVLA×Spatial cell，完成 10 cells full data。\n814\t\n815\t    '\n816\t  expected_results:\n817\t    trained_r2_image_mean_peak:\n818\t      layer: L10\n819\t      R2: 0.662\n820\t    trained_r2_last_preaction_peak:\n821\t      layer: L14\n822\t      R2: 0.67\n823\t    trained_r2_last_preaction_exit_L31: 0.54\n824\t    trained_exit_collapse_delta: 0.13\n825\t    untrained_r2_image_mean_peak:\n826\t      layer: L13\n827\t      R2: 0.848\n828\t    untrained_r2_image_mean_exit_L31: 0.836\n829\t    untrained_r2_last_preaction_peak:\n830\t      layer: L22\n831\t      R2: 0.828\n832\t    untrained_r2_last_preaction_exit_L31: 0.812\n833\t    untrained_exit_collapse_delta: 0.016\n834\t    trained_L1_instruction_dominant: 24\n835\t    trained_L1_total_heads: 32\n836\t    untrained_L1_instruction_dominant: 25\n837\t    untrained_L1_total_heads: 32\n838\t    trained_image_mean_all_layers: 0.1\n839\t    trained_last_preaction_L1: 0.989\n840\t    trained_last_preaction_L2_plus: 1.0\n841\t    untrained_last_preaction_all_layers: 1.0\n842\t    trained_rsa_peak:\n843\t      layer: L14\n844\t      rsa: 0.69\n845\t    untrained_rsa_peak:\n846\t      layer: L13\n847\t      rsa: 0.52\n848\t    trained_cf_empty_d: 0.94\n849\t    trained_cf_wrong_d: 0.85\n850\t    trained_cf_shuffled_d: 0.83\n851\t    trained_cf_paraphrased_d: 0.81\n852\t    untrained_cf_empty_d: 1.02\n853\t    untrained_cf_wrong_d: 0.82\n854\t    untrained_cf_shuffled_d: 0.61\n855\t    untrained_cf_paraphrased_d: 0.59\n856\t  result_rationale: '**R² Exit Collapse (trained Δ=0.130 >> untrained Δ=0.016)**:\n857\t\n858\t    Spatial suite 确认 exit collapse，Δ=0.130 > 0.08 threshold。比 Goal（Δ=0.150）\n859\t\n860\t    稍低，与 OpenVLA Object（Δ=0.121）更接近——Spatial 和 Object 都是操作性任务，\n861\t\n862\t    instruction routing 需求类似。Untrained (OXE) 保持 flat profile（Δ=0.016），\n863\t\n864\t    与 Long suite（Δ=0.016）一致，进一步确认 OXE 通用训练不产生 exit collapse。\n865\t\n866\t\n867\t    OXE model 的 R² 绝对值在 Spatial 上略低于 Long（image_mean peak 0.848 vs 0.848\n868\t\n869\t    几乎相同），这合理因为 OXE 训练包含多种 embodiment/task，Spatial manipulation\n870\t\n871\t    tasks 在 OXE 训练集中有 reasonable coverage。\n872\t\n873\t\n874\t    **L1 Attention**: 与 Goal cell 一致（24/32 trained, 25/32 OXE），因为 L1 routing\n875\t\n876\t    由 model weights 决定而非 input data。同一模型在不同 suite 上的 L1 pattern 应\n877\t\n878\t    高度一致。\n879\t\n880\t\n881\t    **Cross-Instruction**: Trained L1 accuracy 0.989 略低于 Goal 的 0.996，可能因为\n882\t\n883\t    Spatial suite 的 instruction 之间 overlap 更大（多个 \"put X on Y\" 结构相似）。\n884\t\n885\t    L2+ 仍为 100%。OXE untrained 全层 100%。\n886\t\n887\t\n888\t    **RSA**: Trained peak L14（0.69）与 plan_010 Spatial benchmark 数据（peak L14-15,\n889\t\n890\t    RSA≈0.69）高度一致。这不是巧合——相同任务、相同 model family（OpenVLA），\n891\t\n892\t    RSA profile 应该 reproducible。\n893\t\n894\t\n895\t    **CF**: Trained CF d 值 0.81-0.94，四个条件间差距比 Goal 更紧凑。Spatial tasks\n896\t\n897\t    的 instruction 结构更同质化（\"pick and place\" variants），导致 wrong/shuffled/para\n898\t\n899\t    的 CF 效应差异缩小。Empty 仍最强因为完全移除 instruction 是最极端的 counterfactual。\n900\t\n901\t\n902\t    **Matrix completion**: 此 cell 是第 10 个 full-data cell，完成 3×4 矩阵。\n903\t\n904\t    10/10 cells with data，9/10 confirm exit collapse（仅 OFT outlier 不确认）。\n905\t\n906\t    '\n907\t  tables:\n908\t  - title: 'OpenVLA × Spatial: R² Exit Collapse'\n909\t    columns:\n910\t    - Condition\n911\t    - R² Peak\n912\t    - Peak Layer\n913\t    - R² Exit (L31)\n914\t    - Δ\n915\t    - Collapse?\n916\t    rows:\n917\t    - - Trained (Spatial-finetuned)\n918\t      - '0.670'\n919\t      - L14\n920\t      - '0.540'\n921\t      - '0.130'\n922\t      - Yes (> 0.08)\n923\t    - - Untrained (OXE pretrained)\n924\t      - '0.828'\n925\t      - L22\n926\t      - '0.812'\n927\t      - '0.016'\n928\t      - 'No'\n929\t  - title: Complete 3×4 R² Exit Collapse Matrix (10 cells)\n930\t    columns:\n931\t    - Architecture\n932\t    - Goal Δ\n933\t    - Spatial Δ\n934\t    - Object Δ\n935\t    - Long Δ\n936\t    rows:\n937\t    - - OpenVLA (Llama-2-7B)\n938\t      - 0.150 ✓\n939\t      - 0.130 ✓\n940\t      - 0.121 ✓\n941\t      - 0.004 △ OFT\n942\t    - - TracVLA (Phi-3-mini)\n943\t      - 0.228 ✓\n944\t      - 0.138 ✓\n945\t      - 0.294 ✓\n946\t      - 0.198 ✓\n947\t    - - NORA (Qwen2.5-VL-3B)\n948\t      - 0.691 ✓\n949\t      - 0.302 ✓\n950\t      - — (no ckpt)\n951\t      - — (no ckpt)\n952\t  figures_description:\n953\t  - '10-cell heatmap: 3 arch × 4 suite，色深编码 Δ magnitude，OFT cell 灰色标注'\n954\t  - 'Per-layer R² overlay: OpenVLA Goal + Spatial + Object + Long trained profiles'\n955\t  analysis: '第 10 个 cell 完成。矩阵汇总：9/10 cells confirm exit collapse，mean Δ=0.226。\n956\t\n957\t    OpenVLA 三个 full-training suite（Goal/Spatial/Object）Δ 在 0.12-0.15 范围内一致。\n958\t\n959\t    NORA 最极端（0.30-0.69），TracVLA 中等（0.14-0.29）。跨架构 Δ 差异反映\n960\t\n961\t    backbone capacity 和 training recipe 差异，但 presence of collapse 是 universal。\n962\t\n963\t    '\n964\t- name: Batch Untrained Counterfactual (Missing Matrix Cells)\n965\t  plan_id: cf_batch_missing_v1\n966\t  description: '批量补跑缺失的 untrained counterfactual cells：OpenVLA Object untrained (OXE),\n967\t\n968\t    TracVLA Spatial/Object untrained (Phi-3-Vision)。使用 cosine_dist 方法\n969\t\n970\t    （untrained VLM 无法生成有意义 actions，改用 hidden representation 距离）。\n971\t\n972\t    '\n973\t  expected_results:\n974\t    openvla_object_untrained_empty_cos_dist: 0.085\n975\t    openvla_object_untrained_wrong_cos_dist: 0.052\n976\t    openvla_object_untrained_shuffled_cos_dist: 0.045\n977\t    openvla_object_untrained_para_cos_dist: 0.025\n978\t    openvla_object_untrained_ordering: empty > wrong > shuffled > para\n979\t    tracvla_spatial_untrained_empty_cos_dist: 0.148\n980\t    tracvla_spatial_untrained_shuffled_cos_dist: 0.078\n981\t    tracvla_spatial_untrained_wrong_cos_dist: 0.018\n982\t    tracvla_spatial_untrained_para_cos_dist: 0.005\n983\t    tracvla_spatial_untrained_ordering: empty >> shuffled > wrong > para\n984\t    tracvla_object_untrained_empty_cos_dist: 0.142\n985\t    tracvla_object_untrained_shuffled_cos_dist: 0.072\n986\t    tracvla_object_untrained_wrong_cos_dist: 0.015\n987\t    tracvla_object_untrained_para_cos_dist: 0.004\n988\t    tracvla_object_untrained_ordering: empty >> shuffled > wrong > para\n989\t    method_note: cosine_dist (untrained) vs cohens_d (trained) — orderings comparable,\n990\t      magnitudes not\n991\t  result_rationale: '**OpenVLA Object untrained (OXE pretrained, Tier 2)**:\n992\t\n993\t    OXE 模型的 CF pattern 应与 Long suite（empty cos=0.085, wrong=0.052）高度一致，\n994\t\n995\t    因为同一模型。cos_dist 值反映 hidden representation 对 instruction 变化的响应。\n996\t\n997\t    OXE 的 970K 通用训练已创建 instruction-sensitive representations，所以 cos_dist\n998\t\n999\t    非零且有 ordering。Ordering (empty > wrong > shuffled > para) 与 trained 一致，\n1000\t\n1001\t    但 magnitude 小于 trained 的 Cohen''s d（方法差异 + 通用 vs task-specific routing）。\n1002\t\n1003\t\n1004\t    **TracVLA Spatial/Object untrained (Phi-3-Vision, Tier 1)**:\n1005\t\n1006\t    Phi-3-Vision 作为纯 VLM base，其 CF pattern 应与 Goal/Long untrained 一致\n1007\t\n1008\t    （cf_batch_part2_v1: goal empty cos=0.153, long empty cos=0.173）。Spatial（0.148）\n1009\t\n1010\t    和 Object（0.142）的 empty cos_dist 略低于 Long（0.173），因为 spatial/object\n1011\t\n1012\t    instruction 的语义差异小于 long-horizon tasks。\n1013\t\n1014\t\n1015\t    关键 pattern：Phi-3-Vision untrained 的 ordering 是 empty >> shuffled > wrong > para\n1016\t\n1017\t    （注意 shuffled > wrong，与 trained 的 wrong > shuffled 不同）。这是因为 VLM base\n1018\t\n1019\t    主要响应 surface-level token 变化（shuffled 改变所有 token 位置，wrong 保留相似\n1020\t\n1021\t    语法结构），而 trained model 响应 semantic 变化（wrong task 语义完全不同，比\n1022\t\n1023\t    shuffled 更极端）。这一 ordering difference 是 training-induced semantic sensitivity\n1024\t\n1025\t    的间接证据。\n1026\t\n1027\t\n1028\t    **Cross-Tier comparison**:\n1029\t\n1030\t    - Tier 1 (VLM): cos_dist 0.005-0.173，weak and position-dominated\n1031\t\n1032\t    - Tier 2 (OXE): cos_dist 0.025-0.085，moderate, ordering matches trained\n1033\t\n1034\t    - Tier 3 (task-specific): Cohen''s d 0.70-1.52，strong, semantic ordering\n1035\t\n1036\t    CF sensitivity 在三个 tier 间 monotonically 增强，支持 routing gradient 叙事。\n1037\t\n1038\t    '\n1039\t  tables:\n1040\t  - title: 'Untrained CF: Cross-Architecture Comparison (cosine_dist)'\n1041\t    columns:\n1042\t    - Model\n1043\t    - Suite\n1044\t    - empty\n1045\t    - shuffled\n1046\t    - wrong\n1047\t    - para\n1048\t    - Tier\n1049\t    rows:\n1050\t    - - OXE (Llama-2)\n1051\t      - Object\n1052\t      - '0.085'\n1053\t      - '0.045'\n1054\t      - '0.052'\n1055\t      - '0.025'\n1056\t      - Tier 2\n1057\t    - - OXE (Llama-2)\n1058\t      - Long\n1059\t      - 0.085*\n1060\t      - —\n1061\t      - —\n1062\t      - —\n1063\t      - Tier 2 (ref)\n1064\t    - - Phi-3-Vision\n1065\t      - Spatial\n1066\t      - '0.148'\n1067\t      - '0.078'\n1068\t      - '0.018'\n1069\t      - '0.005'\n1070\t      - Tier 1\n1071\t    - - Phi-3-Vision\n1072\t      - Object\n1073\t      - '0.142'\n1074\t      - '0.072'\n1075\t      - '0.015'\n1076\t      - '0.004'\n1077\t      - Tier 1\n1078\t    - - Phi-3-Vision\n1079\t      - Goal\n1080\t      - 0.153*\n1081\t      - 0.084*\n1082\t      - 0.016*\n1083\t      - 0.004*\n1084\t      - Tier 1 (ref)\n1085\t    - - Phi-3-Vision\n1086\t      - Long\n1087\t      - 0.173*\n1088\t      - 0.120*\n1089\t      - 0.022*\n1090\t      - 0.007*\n1091\t      - Tier 1 (ref)\n1092\t    - - Qwen2.5-VL\n1093\t      - Goal\n1094\t      - 0.081*\n1095\t      - 0.033*\n1096\t      - 0.014*\n1097\t      - 0.004*\n1098\t      - Tier 1 (ref)\n1099\t  - title: Trained vs Untrained CF Ordering Comparison\n1100\t    columns:\n1101\t    - Condition\n1102\t    - 1st\n1103\t    - 2nd\n1104\t    - 3rd\n1105\t    - 4th\n1106\t    - Interpretation\n1107\t    rows:\n1108\t    - - Trained (all arch)\n1109\t      - empty\n1110\t      - wrong\n1111\t      - shuffled\n1112\t      - para\n1113\t      - semantic sensitivity\n1114\t    - - Untrained VLM (Phi-3/Qwen)\n1115\t      - empty\n1116\t      - shuffled\n1117\t      - wrong\n1118\t      - para\n1119\t      - positional sensitivity\n1120\t    - - Untrained OXE (Llama-2)\n1121\t      - empty\n1122\t      - wrong\n1123\t      - shuffled\n1124\t      - para\n1125\t      - partial semantic\n1126\t  figures_description:\n1127\t  - 'Grouped bar chart: 3 tiers × 4 CF conditions，showing sensitivity gradient'\n1128\t  - 'Ordering comparison diagram: arrows showing how CF ranking shifts with training\n1129\t    tier'\n1130\t  analysis: 'Batch CF 补全后，untrained CF data 覆盖全部活跃 matrix cells。\n1131\t\n1132\t    Tier 1→2→3 的 CF sensitivity monotonic 增强确认 routing gradient。\n1133\t\n1134\t    Trained 和 untrained 的 ordering difference（wrong vs shuffled 位置互换）\n1135\t\n1136\t    是 training-induced semantic sensitivity 的 indirect evidence。\n1137\t\n1138\t    '\n1139\t- name: D095 Cross-Architecture Consolidated Matrix Analysis\n1140\t  plan_id: d095_synthesis\n1141\t  description: '汇总全部 3 arch × 4 suite 矩阵数据，计算 aggregate metrics，\n1142\t\n1143\t    验证 best tier key indicators 全部达标。\n1144\t\n1145\t    '\n1146\t  expected_results:\n1147\t    matrix_cells_with_full_data: 10\n1148\t    matrix_total_possible: 12\n1149\t    missing_cells: NORA Object, NORA Long (no finetuned checkpoints)\n1150\t    r2_collapse_confirmed_cells: 9\n1151\t    r2_collapse_rejected_cells: 1\n1152\t    r2_collapse_outlier: OpenVLA Long (OFT, Δ=0.004)\n1153\t    mean_trained_exit_delta: 0.226\n1154\t    median_trained_exit_delta: 0.168\n1155\t    trained_delta_range:\n1156\t    - 0.004\n1157\t    - 0.691\n1158\t    trained_delta_iqr:\n1159\t    - 0.128\n1160\t    - 0.296\n1161\t    mean_untrained_exit_delta: 0.032\n1162\t    cf_sensitivity_ratio_tracvla: 8.1\n1163\t    cf_sensitivity_ratio_nora: 12.3\n1164\t    cf_sensitivity_ratio_overall: 9.5\n1165\t    cf_empty_first_fraction: 11/12 trained settings\n1166\t    cross_arch_r2_peak_layer_std: 2.4\n1167\t    cross_arch_inverted_u_confirmed: 3/3 architectures\n1168\t    cross_arch_exit_collapse_confirmed: 3/3 architectures\n1169\t    openvla_L1_gradient: untrained 0/32 → OXE 25/32 → trained 24/32\n1170\t    tracvla_L1_trained: 27-30/32\n1171\t    tracvla_L1_untrained: 32/32 (Phi-3-Vision pre-existing)\n1172\t    nora_L1_trained: 12-13/16\n1173\t    nora_L1_untrained: 13-14/16 (Qwen2.5-VL pre-existing)\n1174\t    d090_conclusion: L1 is base-model-dependent, NOT training-induced\n1175\t    tier1_signature: no exit collapse, weak CF (cos < 0.2), L1 from LLM pretraining\n1176\t    tier2_signature: no exit collapse, strong CF (d ≈ 1.0), L1 from OXE pretraining\n1177\t    tier3_signature: exit collapse (Δ > 0.08), task-specific CF, L1 ≈ OXE level\n1178\t    expected_reviewer_avg_score:\n1179\t    - 5.5\n1180\t    - 7.0\n1181\t    accept_probability:\n1182\t    - 0.55\n1183\t    - 0.75\n1184\t  result_rationale: '**Matrix completeness (10/12)**: NORA 仅 Goal+Spatial 因为无 Object/Long\n1185\t    finetuned checkpoint\n1186\t\n1187\t    （D089 决定）。10 cells 覆盖 3 architectures × 至少 2 suites，足以 claim cross-architecture\n1188\t\n1189\t    generalization。12 cells 中 10 个 filled = 83% coverage，CoRL standard 下可接受。\n1190\t\n1191\t\n1192\t    **R² exit collapse (9/10 confirmed, mean Δ=0.226)**:\n1193\t\n1194\t    9 cells 确认 trained Δ > 0.08，mean Δ=0.226 落入 best tier [0.2, 0.35] 的下半段。\n1195\t\n1196\t    Median Δ=0.168 更保守但仍远超 untrained mean（0.032）。跨架构一致性：OpenVLA\n1197\t\n1198\t    （Δ=0.12-0.15, Llama-2），TracVLA（Δ=0.14-0.29, Phi-3），NORA（Δ=0.30-0.69, Qwen2.5-VL）。\n1199\t\n1200\t    NORA 最极端可能因 GQA 架构（16h/2kv）导致更尖锐的 routing 重塑。OFT outlier（Δ=0.004）\n1201\t\n1202\t    被 D091 解释为 parameter-efficient finetuning 特例：TracVLA Long trained（full finetuning）\n1203\t\n1204\t    在同一 suite 上 Δ=0.198，证明 Long suite 本身不是问题。\n1205\t\n1206\t\n1207\t    **CF sensitivity ratio (9.5×)**:\n1208\t\n1209\t    跨 VLM-base architectures，trained CF sensitivity / untrained CF sensitivity ≈ 7-12×。\n1210\t\n1211\t    TracVLA mean ratio = (1.52/0.153 + 1.33/0.180 + 1.21/0.185 + 1.47/0.173) / 4 ≈\n1212\t    8.1×。\n1213\t\n1214\t    NORA Goal: 训练后 cosine saturated to 1.0 vs untrained 0.081 → ratio 极端但 metric\n1215\t\n1216\t    ceiling 导致不可比。Excluding NORA saturation，overall ratio ≈ 8-10×，comfortably in [7,\n1217\t    12]。\n1218\t\n1219\t\n1220\t    **Cross-architecture R² peak layer std (2.4)**:\n1221\t\n1222\t    OpenVLA peak L8-L13（center ~L10），TracVLA peak L4-L22（center ~L14），\n1223\t\n1224\t    NORA peak L10。std(10, 14, 10) ≈ 1.9-2.4，在 [1.5, 3.0] 内。Peak layer 跨架构\n1225\t\n1226\t    一致性说明 mid-layer integration 是 architecture-independent phenomenon。\n1227\t\n1228\t\n1229\t    **D090 区分**:\n1230\t\n1231\t    L1 head count 清晰分为两类：(a) Training-induced = 0（TracVLA/NORA untrained 已有\n1232\t\n1233\t    strong L1），(b) Pre-existing = 高（来自 VLM/LLM 预训练）。只有 OpenVLA 的\n1234\t\n1235\t    untrained=random init 显示 L1=0，但这是因为 random init 无任何语言能力。OXE pretrained\n1236\t\n1237\t    OpenVLA 已有 25/32。论文明确 claim：R² exit collapse 和 CF sensitivity 是\n1238\t\n1239\t    architecture-independent training effects，L1 head count 不是。\n1240\t\n1241\t\n1242\t    **三层级梯度**:\n1243\t\n1244\t    Tier 1→2→3 在 exit collapse（无→无→有）、CF sensitivity（弱→强→强+task-specific）、\n1245\t\n1246\t    和 routing pattern（无→通用→task-specific）上形成 monotonic gradient。这不是\n1247\t\n1248\t    binary creation story 而是 progressive emergence + reshaping story——更 nuanced，\n1249\t\n1250\t    更符合 developmental/training dynamics 的实际过程。\n1251\t\n1252\t\n1253\t    **Paper strength assessment**:\n1254\t\n1255\t    三个贡献全部 land：(1) Framework validated on 3×4=10 cells，(2) exit collapse +\n1256\t\n1257\t    CF 作为 architecture-independent signatures 有 9/10 cells 支持，(3) 三层级梯度\n1258\t\n1259\t    是 genuine new finding with clear mechanistic interpretation。D090 区分增强而非\n1260\t\n1261\t    削弱可信度。Expected reviewer score 5.5-7.0 基于：strong methodology (+)，\n1262\t\n1263\t    comprehensive validation (+)，clear narrative (+)，no closed-loop evaluation (-)，\n1264\t\n1265\t    open-loop only (-)，representational analysis 在 robotics venue 的 novelty concern\n1266\t    (-)。\n1267\t\n1268\t    Accept probability 55-75% 考虑了 CoRL 的 acceptance rate (~30%) 和论文的相对强度。\n1269\t\n1270\t    '\n1271\t  tables:\n1272\t  - title: Complete R² Exit Collapse Matrix (Trained Δ = peak − exit)\n1273\t    columns:\n1274\t    - Architecture (Backbone)\n1275\t    - Goal\n1276\t    - Spatial\n1277\t    - Object\n1278\t    - Long\n1279\t    - Mean Δ\n1280\t    rows:\n1281\t    - - OpenVLA (Llama-2-7B, 32L, MHA)\n1282\t      - 0.150 ✓\n1283\t      - 0.130 ✓\n1284\t      - 0.121 ✓\n1285\t      - 0.004 △\n1286\t      - '0.101'\n1287\t    - - TracVLA (Phi-3-mini, 32L, MHA)\n1288\t      - 0.228 ✓\n1289\t      - 0.138 ✓\n1290\t      - 0.294 ✓\n1291\t      - 0.198 ✓\n1292\t      - '0.215'\n1293\t    - - NORA (Qwen2.5-VL-3B, 36L, GQA)\n1294\t      - 0.691 ✓\n1295\t      - 0.302 ✓\n1296\t      - —\n1297\t      - —\n1298\t      - '0.497'\n1299\t    - - Column Mean\n1300\t      - '0.356'\n1301\t      - '0.190'\n1302\t      - '0.208'\n1303\t      - '0.101'\n1304\t      - 0.226 overall\n1305\t  - title: L1 Instruction-Dominant Heads (D090 Separation)\n1306\t    columns:\n1307\t    - Architecture\n1308\t    - Trained\n1309\t    - Untrained\n1310\t    - Training-Induced?\n1311\t    - Source\n1312\t    rows:\n1313\t    - - OpenVLA (random init)\n1314\t      - 24/32\n1315\t      - 0/32\n1316\t      - Appears so\n1317\t      - No LLM pretraining\n1318\t    - - OpenVLA (OXE pretrained)\n1319\t      - 24/32\n1320\t      - 25/32\n1321\t      - 'No'\n1322\t      - OXE pretraining\n1323\t    - - TracVLA\n1324\t      - 27-30/32\n1325\t      - 32/32\n1326\t      - No (decreased)\n1327\t      - Phi-3-Vision pretraining\n1328\t    - - NORA\n1329\t      - 12-13/16\n1330\t      - 13-14/16\n1331\t      - No (stable)\n1332\t      - Qwen2.5-VL pretraining\n1333\t  - title: Three-Tier Routing Gradient\n1334\t    columns:\n1335\t    - Tier\n1336\t    - Representative\n1337\t    - R² Exit Collapse\n1338\t    - CF empty d/cos\n1339\t    - L1 Routing\n1340\t    - Interpretation\n1341\t    rows:\n1342\t    - - 'Tier 1: VLM base'\n1343\t      - Phi-3-Vision / Qwen2.5-VL\n1344\t      - None (Δ < 0.05)\n1345\t      - cos < 0.2\n1346\t      - From LLM pretrain\n1347\t      - No action routing\n1348\t    - - 'Tier 2: OXE VLA'\n1349\t      - openvla-7b (970K eps)\n1350\t      - None (Δ = 0.02)\n1351\t      - d ≈ 1.05\n1352\t      - 25/32 from OXE\n1353\t      - General routing\n1354\t    - - 'Tier 3: Task VLA'\n1355\t      - All 3 finetuned VLAs\n1356\t      - Yes (Δ = 0.12-0.69)\n1357\t      - d ≈ 0.7-1.5\n1358\t      - ≈ Tier 2 level\n1359\t      - Task-specific routing\n1360\t  - title: Best Tier Key Indicator Verification\n1361\t    columns:\n1362\t    - Indicator\n1363\t    - Target Range\n1364\t    - Predicted Value\n1365\t    - Status\n1366\t    rows:\n1367\t    - - r2_collapse_confirmed_cells\n1368\t      - '[9, 10]'\n1369\t      - '9'\n1370\t      - ✓ in range\n1371\t    - - mean_trained_exit_delta\n1372\t      - '[0.2, 0.35]'\n1373\t      - '0.226'\n1374\t      - ✓ in range\n1375\t    - - cf_sensitivity_ratio\n1376\t      - '[7, 12]'\n1377\t      - '9.5'\n1378\t      - ✓ in range\n1379\t    - - matrix_cells_with_full_data\n1380\t      - '[9, 10]'\n1381\t      - '10'\n1382\t      - ✓ in range\n1383\t    - - cross_arch_r2_peak_layer_std\n1384\t      - '[1.5, 3.0]'\n1385\t      - '2.4'\n1386\t      - ✓ in range\n1387\t    - - expected_reviewer_avg_score\n1388\t      - '[5.5, 7.0]'\n1389\t      - '6.2'\n1390\t      - ✓ in range\n1391\t    - - accept_probability\n1392\t      - '[0.55, 0.75]'\n1393\t      - '0.65'\n1394\t      - ✓ in range\n1395\t  figures_description:\n1396\t  - '3×4 heatmap matrix: exit collapse Δ，色深从白(0)到深红(0.7)，OFT cell 特殊标注'\n1397\t  - 'Three-tier gradient schematic: VLM→OXE→Task 的 routing evolution，标注 what emerges\n1398\t    vs what reshapes'\n1399\t  - 'Radar chart: 7 key indicators vs target ranges，显示 best tier alignment'\n1400\t  analysis: 'All 7 key indicators 落入 best tier target range。矩阵完整（10/12 cells），\n1401\t\n1402\t    cross-architecture exit collapse confirmed（9/10），三层级梯度 clean，\n1403\t\n1404\t    D090 区分增强 scientific rigor。论文 ready for CoRL submission at D095 strength。\n1405\t\n1406\t    主要 risk factors：(1) no closed-loop evaluation（-1 点 reviewer penalty），\n1407\t\n1408\t    (2) representational analysis 在 robotics venue 的 novelty perception，\n1409\t\n1410\t    (3) OFT outlier 的 explanation 是否被 accept。Best case: 6.2 avg score, 65% accept。'\n1411\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6f46fab0-1092-4dec-b5ea-345cef574fce","uuid":"c6e930fc-a6ba-4062-b798-4d819ce2cb81","timestamp":"2026-05-22T03:12:23.363Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/projects/vla-ssd/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260522T021705/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'D095 framing 完全成立。三层贡献均 land：(1) 系统性 token-level 框架在 3 arch ×\n  4 suite 上验证，\n\n  (2) R² exit collapse + CF sensitivity 作为 architecture-independent training signatures（9/10\n  cells 确认），\n\n  (3) 三层级路由梯度（VLM base→OXE-VLA→task-VLA）作为 genuine new finding。\n\n\n  RUNNING 的 OpenVLA Goal/Spatial 实验完成后矩阵扩展为 10 cells full data。两个新 cell 均确认\n\n  exit collapse（trained Δ > 0.08），mean_trained_exit_delta 落入 ~0.23。OFT outlier 被 framed\n\n  为 parameter-efficient finetuning 特例（D091 已证 TracVLA Long trained L1=30/32 排除任务复杂度解释）。\n\n\n  D090 区分作为科学严谨性体现：论文主动区分 training-induced effects（R² exit collapse, CF\n\n  sensitivity — 三架构一致）与 base-model-dependent effects（L1 head count — 取决于 VLM/LLM\n\n  预训练模式）。这预先回应 reviewer concern \"是否只看预训练效果\"。\n\n\n  三层级路由梯度是叙事升级的关键：从 \"training creates routing\" 升级为 \"routing emerges at\n\n  VLM→VLA transition and reshapes at general→task-specific transition\"。OpenVLA untrained\n\n  (OXE pretrained) 在 Goal/Spatial 上的数据直接支撑 Tier 2（通用 routing 已建立，无 exit collapse），\n\n  与 Tier 3 task-finetuned（exit collapse + task-specific CF）形成对比。\n\n\n  Abstract/claims 保持 D095 强度，标题 \"architecture-independent routing reorganization\"\n  不变。\n\n  C3 保持 qualified observation，不影响 accept/reject，但增加论文分析深度。\n\n  预期 reviewer avg score 5.5-7.0，accept probability 55-75%。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: SigLIP+Projector RSA vs Full VLA vs DINO\n  plan_id: plan_001\n  description: 证明 action-relevant 几何结构源自 frozen vision encoder，LLM 处理反而降低 RSA\n  expected_results:\n    siglip_projector_rsa: 0.615\n    bootstrap_95_ci:\n    - 0.526\n    - 0.695\n    trained_vla_peak_rsa: 0.488\n    untrained_vla_peak_rsa: 0.485\n    dino_rsa: 0.388\n    llm_degradation_magnitude: 0.127\n    ordering: SigLIP+Proj (0.615) >> VLA trained (0.488) ≈ VLA untrained (0.485) >>\n      DINO (0.388)\n  result_rationale: 'Frozen SigLIP+projector 保留最强 action-aligned geometry（RSA=0.615）。LLM\n    各层将表征\n\n    从视觉对齐空间转换到语言/动作解码空间，RSA 降至 ~0.488（降幅 20.7%）。关键发现是\n\n    trained ≈ untrained（Δ=0.003），证明 RSA 测量的几何结构由 frozen encoder 决定，\n\n    LLM 训练不改善这一度量。DINO 虽是强 self-supervised baseline（0.388），但缺乏\n\n    vision-language alignment 导致 RSA 显著低于 SigLIP。这一层级为 C3（encoder geometry\n\n    observation）奠定基础，同时排除了 \"训练改善表征几何\" 的错误 narrative。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Encoder-to-VLA RSA Comparison\n    columns:\n    - Source\n    - RSA ρ\n    - 95% CI\n    - vs DINO Δ\n    rows:\n    - - SigLIP+Proj\n      - '0.615'\n      - '[0.526, 0.695]'\n      - '+0.227'\n    - - VLA Trained Peak\n      - '0.488'\n      - —\n      - '+0.100'\n    - - VLA Untrained Peak\n      - '0.485'\n      - —\n      - '+0.097'\n    - - DINO cls_token\n      - '0.388'\n      - —\n      - baseline\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart: 4 sources (SigLIP, VLA trained, VLA untrained, DINO) RSA 值 with error\n    bars'\n  analysis: 'SigLIP >> VLA >> DINO 层级确立。LLM 是 action-relevant geometry 的消费者而非增强者。\n\n    为 C1 framework 提供定量基础：frozen encoder 是结构源头。\n\n    '\n- name: DINO Baseline RSA\n  plan_id: plan_002\n  description: Standalone DINOv2 作为 vision-only baseline，建立 encoder quality 下界\n  expected_results:\n    temporal_distance_rho_pooled: 0.833\n    per_task_rho_mean: 0.901\n    R2_action_probe: 0.687\n    subtask_macro_auc: 0.972\n    control_b_permutation_rho: 0.039\n  result_rationale: 'DINOv2 cls_token 在纯视觉层面已捕获强时序/动作结构（per-task ρ=0.901，R²=0.687），\n\n    证明 self-supervised per-patch objective 创建了与 robot action 对齐的表征。但 RSA=0.388\n\n    低于 SigLIP(0.615)，说明 vision-language 对齐提供额外增益。Label permutation control\n\n    （ρ=0.039）排除 probe 过拟合。DINOv2 作为 cross-encoder 比较的锚点：任何 VLA encoder\n\n    component 的 RSA 必须 >> 0.388 才有意义。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - DINOv2 per-task ρ 分布 boxplot，显示 cross-task variance\n  analysis: 建立 vision-only floor。DINOv2 R²=0.687 与 VLA best layer 可比，但 RSA 差距大。\n- name: Per-layer RSA Degradation Curve\n  plan_id: plan_003\n  description: 追踪 RSA 从 projector output 到 LLM 各层的变换轨迹，揭示训练如何重塑 layer-wise geometry\n  expected_results:\n    trained_image_mean_pattern: inverted-U\n    trained_image_mean_peak_layer: 12\n    trained_image_mean_peak_rsa: 0.628\n    trained_image_mean_L0_rsa: 0.612\n    trained_image_mean_L32_rsa: 0.422\n    untrained_pattern: monotonic_decay\n    untrained_peak_layer: 0\n    untrained_L0_rsa: 0.612\n    untrained_L32_rsa: 0.545\n    projector_to_L1_drop: 0.13-0.25\n  result_rationale: '训练创造 RSA inverted-U：中层（L12）达到峰值 0.628，说明训练使 LLM 中层成为 action-relevant\n\n    信息整合的场所。Exit 层 RSA 急剧下降至 0.422，反映出口层专注于 action decoding 而非\n\n    保持 geometric alignment。Untrained 模型无此组织——单调衰减说明 random LLM weights\n\n    只是逐层损耗 encoder 传来的结构。两条件在 L0 起点一致（0.612）因为共享 frozen projector\n\n    output。Proj→L1 是最大跳变（20-40% drop），对应 embedding layer 的维度转换。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Per-layer RSA Profile Summary\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - L0\n    - Peak Layer\n    - Peak RSA\n    - L32\n    - Δ(peak-exit)\n    rows:\n    - - Trained img_mean\n      - '0.612'\n      - L12\n      - '0.628'\n      - '0.422'\n      - '0.206'\n    - - Untrained img_mean\n      - '0.612'\n      - L0\n      - '0.612'\n      - '0.545'\n      - '0.067'\n  figures_description:\n  - 双线折线图：trained（红）vs untrained（蓝）RSA across 33 layers，标注 peak + exit\n  analysis: 训练 shifts RSA peak 从 L0→L12，创造 inverted-U。C3 observation 的核心证据。\n- name: Output Head Weight Analysis\n  plan_id: plan_004\n  description: 确认 SigLIP+projector frozen，LLM 权重变化均匀分布，排除 shallow adaptation\n  expected_results:\n    vision_cos_sim: 1.0\n    projector_cos_sim: 1.001\n    llm_mean_rel_change: 1.316\n    llm_rel_change_range:\n    - 1.22\n    - 1.37\n    head_vs_llm_ratio: 1.12\n    shallow_adaptation_gate: FAIL (1.12x < 3x threshold)\n  result_rationale: 'Vision + projector 完全冻结（cos_sim=1.0），确认 C1 的结构基础。LLM 32 层权重变化\n\n    均匀分布（rel_change 1.22-1.37），output head 并非特殊（ratio 1.12x）。排除了\n\n    \"训练只修改最后几层\" 的 shallow adaptation 假设。这解释了为什么 trained ≈ untrained\n\n    在 RSA/R² 上——共享的 frozen components 主导表征结构。注意 untrained 这里是 random init\n\n    vs pretrained Llama，差异主要由预训练 vs 随机决定。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Per-component rel_change bar chart: vision(0) | projector(0) | llm_layers(uniform\n    ~1.3) | head(1.48)'\n  analysis: Frozen encoder 解释了 trained ≈ untrained RSA 收敛。LLM 训练是全局重塑而非局部适配。\n- name: 6 Probing Methods × 2 Benchmarks Systematic Validation\n  plan_id: plan_005\n  description: 多方法多 benchmark 系统验证 trained ≈ untrained >> DINO\n  expected_results:\n    consistency: All 6 methods agree\n    ordering: trained ≈ untrained >> DINO\n    trained_best_rho: 0.955\n    untrained_best_rho: 0.933\n    dino_rho: 0.901\n    action_probe_trained_best_R2: 0.683\n    action_probe_untrained_best_R2: 0.617\n  result_rationale: '六种独立方法（temporal ρ, action probe R², delta probe, RSA, CKA, classification）在两个\n\n    benchmark 上一致显示 trained ≈ untrained >> DINO。方法间一致性排除了单一度量偏见。\n\n    Trained 与 untrained 的差距小（Δρ=0.022, ΔR²=0.066）但 VLA >> DINO 差距大（Δρ=0.054）。\n\n    这确立了核心 narrative：architecture matters（VLA >> DINO），training effect 在表征层面\n\n    有限但可测量。训练效应主要体现在 routing（C2）而非 geometry（C3）。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Heatmap: 6 methods × 3 conditions (trained/untrained/dino) 的 normalized scores'\n  analysis: 多方法一致性是论文方法论贡献的关键证据，支撑 C1 framework 的 reusable value。\n- name: Instruction Ablation\n  plan_id: plan_006\n  description: 去掉 instruction text 测 RSA 变化，验证 action-relevant structure 是 vision-driven\n  expected_results:\n    delta_with_minus_no_inst: 0.004\n    gate_threshold: 0.1\n    gate_judgment: FAIL — vision-driven, not instruction-driven\n    no_inst_untrained_peak_rsa: 0.48\n    with_inst_trained_peak_rsa: 0.488\n  result_rationale: '去掉 instruction 后 RSA 几乎不变（Δ=0.004 << 0.10 threshold），确认 RSA 测量的是\n\n    视觉对齐几何结构。Instruction tokens 通过 causal mask 不影响 image tokens，而 RSA\n\n    主要依赖 image-dominant 的时序结构。这排除了 \"instruction routing 改善 geometric\n\n    alignment\" 的可能解释，将 instruction 效应限定在 routing（C2 attention/probe 级别）\n\n    而非 geometry（C3 RSA 级别）。与 plan_008 的 instruction content invariance 共同\n\n    构成 triple invariance 证据。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: Instruction 不影响 RSA。训练效应在 routing 而非 geometry 层面。\n- name: 2×2 Training × Instruction Matrix\n  plan_id: plan_007\n  description: 四条件全收敛，同时排除 training 和 instruction 对 RSA 的影响\n  expected_results:\n    trained_with_inst: 0.488\n    trained_no_inst: 0.489\n    untrained_with_inst: 0.485\n    untrained_no_inst: 0.48\n    bootstrap_delta_ci: '[-0.058, 0.072] includes 0'\n    convergence_band: 0.48-0.49\n  result_rationale: '四条件在 0.48-0.49 带内收敛，Bootstrap CI 包含 0。Training effect（Δ=0.003-0.009）\n\n    和 instruction effect（Δ=0.001-0.004）均不显著。这是最直接的 null result evidence：\n\n    RSA 对 training 和 instruction 双重不变。Frozen encoder output（0.615）进入 LLM 后\n\n    被降级到 ~0.488，这一降级对 training/instruction 条件不敏感。2×2 factorial design\n\n    排除了交互效应。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 2×2 RSA Convergence Matrix\n    columns:\n    - ''\n    - With Instruction\n    - No Instruction\n    - Instruction Effect\n    rows:\n    - - Trained\n      - '0.488'\n      - '0.489'\n      - '-0.001'\n    - - Untrained\n      - '0.485'\n      - '0.480'\n      - '+0.004'\n    - - Training Effect\n      - '+0.003'\n      - '+0.009'\n      - ''\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 双因素不变性确立。RSA 由 frozen encoder 决定，LLM 条件无关。\n- name: Random Instruction Control\n  plan_id: plan_008\n  description: 三重不变性完备：正常/随机/打乱/空白 instruction 均不影响 RSA\n  expected_results:\n    normal_peak_rsa: 0.489\n    random_peak_rsa: 0.484\n    shuffled_peak_rsa: 0.483\n    empty_peak_rsa: 0.472\n    max_absolute_delta: 0.017\n    instruction_invariant: true\n  result_rationale: '四种 instruction 条件（正常、随机词、打乱、空白）的 RSA 在 ±0.017 内收敛。\n\n    最大偏差来自 empty（0.472 vs normal 0.489），但 Δ=0.017 远小于 meaningful effect。\n\n    三重不变性（training × instruction presence × instruction content）完备：\n\n    RSA 不受任何 instruction 维度影响。这排除了 reviewer 可能提出的 \"trivial separability\"\n\n    攻击——即使给模型无意义输入，geometric alignment 也不变。为 C3 observation 提供\n\n    方法论基础：RSA 测量的纯粹是 visual structure。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: Triple invariance 完备。RSA 是 vision-only metric，强化 C3 scope 限定。\n- name: CKA Verification — Metric Robustness Check\n  plan_id: plan_009\n  description: CKA 指标重复 RSA 发现，发现 ordering reversal — metric dissociation 本身是 finding\n  expected_results:\n    cka_ordering: untrained > trained > projector > DINO\n    rsa_ordering: projector > trained ≈ untrained > DINO\n    dino_lowest_both_metrics: true\n    last_preaction_cka_highest: 0.127\n    dissociation_finding: RSA=geometric alignment (LLM degrades), CKA=global structure\n      (LLM preserves)\n  result_rationale: 'CKA 与 RSA 的 ordering reversal 不是失败而是发现。RSA 测量局部几何对齐（LLM 降低），\n\n    CKA 测量全局结构保持（LLM 维持甚至增强）。这意味着 LLM 训练在保持全局信息结构的\n\n    同时重塑局部几何——与 routing reorganization narrative 一致。DINO 在两个指标下均最低\n\n    是 robust 发现。last_preaction CKA=0.127 >> image_mean CKA=0.089 确认 instruction\n\n    tokens 携带更多全局结构信息。metric dissociation 增强论文深度：C3 需加 \"under RSA\"\n\n    qualifier，但 \"geometric degradation + structural preservation\" 是比单一结果更丰富的故事。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: RSA vs CKA Ordering Comparison\n    columns:\n    - Source\n    - RSA Rank\n    - Linear CKA Rank\n    - RDM-CKA Rank\n    rows:\n    - - SigLIP+Proj\n      - 1st (0.615)\n      - 3rd (0.081)\n      - 2nd (0.257)\n    - - VLA Trained\n      - 2nd (0.488)\n      - 4th (0.083)\n      - 1st (0.260)\n    - - VLA Untrained\n      - 3rd (0.485)\n      - 2nd (0.089)\n      - 3rd (0.246)\n    - - DINO\n      - 4th (0.388)\n      - 5th (0.066)\n      - 4th (0.241)\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Paired bar chart: RSA vs CKA rankings side-by-side，标注 ordering reversal'\n  analysis: Metric dissociation 本身是 finding。C3 加 qualifier，但 story 变得更丰富。\n- name: LIBERO-Spatial Cross-Benchmark Validation\n  plan_id: plan_010\n  description: 第二 benchmark 交叉验证：LIBERO-Spatial 上复现 inverted-U 和 trained > untrained\n  expected_results:\n    trained_image_mean_peak_layer: 13\n    trained_image_mean_peak_R2: 0.696\n    trained_last_preaction_peak_layer: 21\n    trained_last_preaction_peak_R2: 0.675\n    untrained_image_mean_peak_layer: 0\n    untrained_image_mean_peak_R2: 0.673\n    untrained_last_preaction_peak_layer: 1\n    untrained_last_preaction_peak_R2: 0.635\n    bootstrap_best_vs_best_p: 0.001\n    rsa_trained_peak_layer: 14\n    rsa_trained_peak_rsa: 0.691\n    rsa_untrained_peak_layer: 0\n    rsa_untrained_peak_rsa: 0.652\n  result_rationale: 'Spatial 任务复现 Goal 的核心 pattern：(1) R² inverted-U trained peak\n    L13-L21（vs Goal\n\n    L8-L13），(2) trained > untrained 在 best-vs-best 显著（p<0.001），(3) untrained\n\n    deep-layer collapse（L5-L31 R²≈-0.015，仅 L32 恢复）。Peak layer 向后移动 2-8 层\n\n    可能反映 spatial reasoning 需要更深层 processing。RSA 同样显示 trained inverted-U\n\n    （peak L14-15，RSA≈0.69）。Cross-benchmark consistency 高（peak layer 偏移在 2 层\n\n    以内），排除 suite-specific artifact。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Cross-Benchmark R² Peak Comparison\n    columns:\n    - Benchmark\n    - Trained img_mean Peak\n    - Trained lastpre Peak\n    - Consistency\n    rows:\n    - - LIBERO-Goal\n      - L8 (0.655)\n      - L13 (0.678)\n      - —\n    - - LIBERO-Spatial\n      - L13 (0.696)\n      - L21 (0.675)\n      - peak +5/+8 layers\n  figures_description:\n  - 双 benchmark R² profile overlay：Goal（实线）vs Spatial（虚线）\n  analysis: Cross-benchmark 复现成功。Peak layer 偏移在可接受范围内。C1 framework validated。\n- name: Full-layer R² Scan (33 layers × 2 conditions × 2 aggregations)\n  plan_id: plan_011\n  description: 132 probes 验证 R² per-layer curve 与 RSA inverted-U 一致，建立 exit collapse\n    证据\n  expected_results:\n    trained_image_mean_peak:\n      layer: 8\n      R2: 0.655\n    trained_last_preaction_peak:\n      layer: 13\n      R2: 0.678\n    untrained_image_mean_peak:\n      layer: 0\n      R2: 0.64\n    untrained_last_preaction_peak:\n      layer: 32\n      R2: 0.609\n    bootstrap_best_vs_best_image_mean:\n      delta: 0.015\n      p: 0.006\n    bootstrap_best_vs_best_last_preaction:\n      delta: 0.069\n      p: 0.0001\n    rsa_r2_peak_alignment_trained_lastpre: RSA L12, R² L13 — 1-layer offset\n    untrained_pathological_layers: L10-L13 R² ≈ 0 (random init collapsed)\n  result_rationale: 'R² 独立确认 RSA inverted-U pattern。Trained last_preaction peak L13（R²=0.678）与\n\n    RSA peak L12 仅 1 层偏移，说明 geometric alignment 和 functional decodability 在训练后\n\n    近乎对齐。Untrained 的 L10-L13 pathological collapse（R²≈0, 甚至 -0.33）是 random init\n\n    LLM 在深层创造不可解码表征的证据——这是训练 restructures representations 的最直观\n\n    证据。best-vs-best 比较：image_mean Δ=0.015（p=0.006, marginal），last_preaction\n\n    Δ=0.069（p<0.0001, highly significant）。last_preaction 从 untrained L32 peak 到\n\n    trained L13 peak 的迁移是 training-induced routing reorganization 的 R² 层面证据。\n\n    这组数据是 C2 exit collapse claim 在 OpenVLA 单架构上的基础。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: R² Peak Summary (OpenVLA on LIBERO-Goal)\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - Readout\n    - Peak Layer\n    - Peak R²\n    - Exit R²\n    - Δ\n    rows:\n    - - Trained\n      - image_mean\n      - L8\n      - '0.655'\n      - ~0.45\n      - ~0.20\n    - - Trained\n      - last_preaction\n      - L13\n      - '0.678'\n      - ~0.55\n      - ~0.13\n    - - Untrained\n      - image_mean\n      - L0\n      - '0.640'\n      - ~0.35\n      - ~0.29\n    - - Untrained\n      - last_preaction\n      - L32\n      - '0.609'\n      - —\n      - baseline\n  figures_description:\n  - 4-panel per-layer R² curve：trained/untrained × image_mean/last_preaction，标注 peak\n    + pathological zones\n  analysis: R² 确认 RSA inverted-U。Exit collapse + pathological layers = training restructuring\n    核心证据。\n- name: CLIP-ViT Pretraining Control\n  plan_id: plan_012\n  description: CLIP ViT-L 替代 SigLIP，区分 vision-language pretraining 贡献 vs encoder quality\n  expected_results:\n    clip_cls_rsa: 0.557\n    clip_cls_R2: 0.587\n    dino_cls_rsa: 0.631\n    dino_cls_R2: 0.634\n    projector_R2: 0.63\n    ordering: VLA last_pre (0.671) > DINO (0.634) ≈ Projector (0.630) > VLA img_mean\n      (0.599) > CLIP (0.587)\n    clip_lt_dino_both: true\n  result_rationale: 'CLIP < DINO 在 RSA（0.557 vs 0.631）和 R²（0.587 vs 0.634）两个维度。这推翻了\n\n    \"vision-language pretraining 优于 self-supervised\" 的直觉。DINOv2 的 per-patch\n\n    self-supervised objective 创造了更丰富的空间表征，与 robot action 结构更对齐。\n\n    CLIP 的 contrastive learning 优化 global image-text matching，不保留 fine-grained\n\n    spatial/temporal 信息。这为 C3 cross-encoder ranking 提供定量基础：在 RSA metric 下\n\n    DINOv2 >> CLIP >> baseline。论文可 claim \"self-supervised spatial features provide\n\n    stronger action-aligned geometry than vision-language contrastive features\"。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Cross-Encoder Unified Comparison\n    columns:\n    - Encoder\n    - RSA\n    - R² (action)\n    - Ranking\n    rows:\n    - - DINOv2 cls\n      - 0.692/0.631\n      - '0.634'\n      - 1st / 2nd\n    - - SigLIP+Proj\n      - '0.615'\n      - '0.630'\n      - 2nd / 3rd\n    - - CLIP ViT-L\n      - '0.557'\n      - '0.587'\n      - 4th / 5th\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Scatter plot: RSA vs R² for all encoder sources'\n  analysis: VL pretraining 不优于 self-supervised。DINOv2 spatial objective 更适合 action\n    alignment。\n- name: Branch-Split RSA (DINOv2 vs SigLIP within Fused Backbone)\n  plan_id: plan_013\n  description: 分离 fused backbone 的两个 branch，定量回答各组件对 action geometry 的贡献\n  expected_results:\n    dinov2_branch_rsa: 0.619\n    siglip_branch_rsa: 0.621\n    fused_2176d_rsa: 0.634\n    post_projector_4096d_rsa: 0.615\n    standalone_dino_cls_rsa: 0.692\n    branch_delta: 0.002\n    fusion_benefit: 0.015\n    projector_compression_loss: 0.019\n  result_rationale: 'Fused backbone 中 DINOv2 branch（0.619）≈ SigLIP branch（0.621），两者贡献均等。\n\n    Fusion > either branch（0.634 vs 0.619/0.621），证明两 branch 提供互补信息。\n\n    Projector 将 2176d fused → 4096d（然后 projection），RSA 从 0.634→0.615（损失 0.019），\n\n    说明降维有信息损耗。Standalone DINOv2 cls（0.692）高于 in-backbone DINOv2（0.619），\n\n    因为提取层不同（standalone 用 cls_token 最终层，in-backbone 经过 fusion averaging）。\n\n    论文结论：两个 vision backbone branch 同等重要，fusion 有互补增益，projector 有微小损耗。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Branch-Split RSA Decomposition\n    columns:\n    - Component\n    - RSA\n    - Note\n    rows:\n    - - DINOv2 branch (1088d)\n      - '0.619'\n      - in-backbone\n    - - SigLIP branch (1088d)\n      - '0.621'\n      - in-backbone\n    - - Fused (2176d)\n      - '0.634'\n      - complementary gain\n    - - Post-projector (4096d)\n      - '0.615'\n      - compression loss -0.019\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Stacked bar: branch contributions + fusion gain + projector loss'\n  analysis: Equal branch contribution + complementary fusion。Projector compression\n    是 RSA 降级的一个源头。\n- name: OpenVLA Goal Standardized Full Pipeline\n  plan_id: openvla_goal_standardized_v1\n  description: 'OpenVLA (Llama-2-7B) 在 LIBERO-Goal 的标准化 5-phase pipeline。\n\n    Trained = openvla-7b-finetuned-libero-goal，Untrained = openvla-7b (OXE pretrained,\n    970K episodes)。\n\n    填充 3×4 矩阵的 OpenVLA×Goal cell，提供 trained vs OXE-pretrained 对比。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    trained_r2_image_mean_peak:\n      layer: L9\n      R2: 0.655\n    trained_r2_last_preaction_peak:\n      layer: L13\n      R2: 0.678\n    trained_r2_last_preaction_exit_L31: 0.528\n    trained_exit_collapse_delta: 0.15\n    untrained_r2_image_mean_peak:\n      layer: L12\n      R2: 0.845\n    untrained_r2_image_mean_exit_L31: 0.832\n    untrained_r2_last_preaction_peak:\n      layer: L21\n      R2: 0.825\n    untrained_r2_last_preaction_exit_L31: 0.805\n    untrained_exit_collapse_delta: 0.02\n    trained_L1_instruction_dominant: 24\n    trained_L1_total_heads: 32\n    trained_L1_mean_text_attn: 0.577\n    untrained_L1_instruction_dominant: 25\n    untrained_L1_total_heads: 32\n    untrained_L1_mean_text_attn: 0.62\n    untrained_L1_mixed_heads: 7\n    trained_image_mean_all_layers: 0.1\n    trained_last_preaction_L1: 0.996\n    trained_last_preaction_L2_plus: 1.0\n    untrained_image_mean_all_layers: 0.1\n    untrained_last_preaction_all_layers: 1.0\n    trained_rsa_peak:\n      layer: L12\n      rsa: 0.628\n    trained_rsa_exit_L31: 0.42\n    untrained_rsa_peak:\n      layer: L12\n      rsa: 0.52\n    untrained_rsa_exit_L31: 0.5\n    trained_cf_empty_d: 0.96\n    trained_cf_wrong_d: 0.91\n    trained_cf_shuffled_d: 0.77\n    trained_cf_paraphrased_d: 0.7\n    trained_cf_ordering: empty > wrong > shuffled > paraphrased\n    untrained_cf_empty_d: 1.05\n    untrained_cf_wrong_d: 0.84\n    untrained_cf_shuffled_d: 0.63\n    untrained_cf_paraphrased_d: 0.61\n    untrained_cf_ordering: empty > wrong > shuffled > paraphrased\n  result_rationale: '**R² Exit Collapse (trained Δ=0.150 >> untrained Δ=0.020)**:\n\n    Trained 模型在 exit layers 出现 R² collapse：last_preaction 从 peak L13=0.678 下降到\n\n    L31=0.528（Δ=0.150），确认 exit collapse > 0.08 threshold。这与 OpenVLA Object\n\n    （Δ=0.121）量级一致，Goal suite 稍高因为 goal-conditioned 任务对 instruction routing\n\n    要求更强，exit 层需要更多 capacity 分配给 action conditioning 而非 instruction retention。\n\n\n    Untrained (OXE pretrained) 模型几乎无 exit collapse（Δ=0.020）。OXE 的 970K episodes\n\n    通用训练创建了 flat R² profile（image_mean: 0.83-0.85 全程平坦；last_preaction: 从 0.61\n\n    monotonic rise 到 0.825 后保持），因为通用训练学到的是 general-purpose routing，不需要\n\n    task-specific exit collapse。R² 绝对值高于 trained 模型（0.845 vs 0.655 for image_mean）\n\n    因为 OXE 模型保留了更多 general action information，而 task-specific fine-tuning 牺牲了\n\n    generality 换取 exit-layer task specialization。\n\n\n    **L1 Attention**: Trained 24/32 instruction-dominant 与 CLAUDE.md 既有数据一致。\n\n    OXE pretrained 25/32 instruction-dominant（从 openvla_long_untrained 数据外推），\n\n    表明 L1 routing 是 OXE pretraining 创建的（D090 base-model-dependent）。训练后 L1\n\n    heads 从 25→24（微小下降），说明 task-specific fine-tuning 不增强 L1 routing 而是\n\n    redistribute 部分 head 用于 task-specific computation。\n\n\n    **Cross-Instruction**: Image_mean = chance (10%) 在两条件下不变（causal mask guarantee）。\n\n    Last_preaction trained 从 L1 即 99.6%（即时路由），untrained (OXE) 全层 100%（OXE\n\n    pretraining 已建立强 instruction encoding）。差异在于 untrained 的 \"100%\" 来自通用\n\n    routing，trained 的 \"100%\" 来自 task-specific routing — probe accuracy 饱和无法区分，\n\n    但 R² exit collapse 和 CF 可以。\n\n\n    **RSA**: Trained inverted-U peak L12（0.628）与 plan_003 一致。Untrained (OXE) peak\n\n    也在 L12（0.52），但整体 RSA lower 因为 OXE 模型已部分重塑 geometry。\n\n\n    **Counterfactual**: Trained CF ordering（empty>wrong>shuffled>para）与 10-task 数据\n\n    一致。d 值 0.70-0.96 处于中等-强效应。OXE untrained 也显示强 CF（empty d=1.05），\n\n    这是 D094 三层级梯度的关键证据——Tier 2 (OXE VLA) 已有 CF sensitivity（通用 routing），\n\n    但缺乏 exit collapse（task-specific routing）。Trained vs OXE 的 CF 差异小于 trained\n\n    vs VLM-base 差异，进一步支持 \"routing reshapes at task-specific transition\" 叙事。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'OpenVLA × Goal: R² Exit Collapse'\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - R² Peak\n    - Peak Layer\n    - R² Exit (L31)\n    - Δ (peak-exit)\n    - Collapse?\n    rows:\n    - - Trained (LIBERO-finetuned)\n      - '0.678'\n      - L13\n      - '0.528'\n      - '0.150'\n      - Yes (> 0.08)\n    - - Untrained (OXE pretrained)\n      - '0.825'\n      - L21\n      - '0.805'\n      - '0.020'\n      - 'No'\n  - title: 'OpenVLA × Goal: L1 Attention & CF'\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - L1 Instr-Dom Heads\n    - Text Attn %\n    - CF empty d\n    - CF ordering\n    rows:\n    - - Trained\n      - 24/32\n      - 57.7%\n      - '0.96'\n      - empty > wrong > shuf > para\n    - - Untrained (OXE)\n      - 25/32\n      - 62.0%\n      - '1.05'\n      - empty > wrong > shuf > para\n  - title: 'Three-Tier Gradient: Goal Suite'\n    columns:\n    - Tier\n    - Model\n    - L1 Heads\n    - CF d (empty)\n    - R² Exit Δ\n    - Exit Collapse?\n    rows:\n    - - Tier 1 (VLM base)\n      - Llama-2-7B random init\n      - 0/32\n      - ~0\n      - N/A (pathological)\n      - N/A\n    - - Tier 2 (OXE VLA)\n      - openvla-7b\n      - 25/32\n      - '1.05'\n      - '0.020'\n      - 'No'\n    - - Tier 3 (Task VLA)\n      - openvla-goal-finetuned\n      - 24/32\n      - '0.96'\n      - '0.150'\n      - 'Yes'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Per-layer R² profiles: trained（红实线）vs OXE-untrained（蓝虚线），双 readout，标注 exit collapse\n    zone'\n  - 'L1 attention heatmap: 32 heads × 2 conditions，instruction-dominant highlighted'\n  - 'CF sensitivity bar chart: 4 counterfactual conditions × 2 model conditions'\n  analysis: 'OpenVLA Goal cell 确认 exit collapse（Δ=0.150 > 0.08）和三层级梯度。\n\n    OXE pretrained 作为 Tier 2 提供关键对比：已有 L1 routing 和 CF，但无 exit collapse。\n\n    这直接支持 \"routing emerges at VLM→VLA, reshapes at general→task-specific\" 叙事。\n\n    L1 heads 24 vs 25 的微小差异支持 D090：L1 routing 是 base-model-dependent。\n\n    此 cell 加入后 matrix_cells_with_full_data = 9。\n\n    '\n- name: OpenVLA Spatial Standardized Full Pipeline\n  plan_id: openvla_spatial_standardized_v1\n  description: 'OpenVLA (Llama-2-7B) 在 LIBERO-Spatial 的标准化 6-phase pipeline。\n\n    Trained = openvla-7b-finetuned-libero-spatial，Untrained = openvla-7b (OXE pretrained)。\n\n    填充 3×4 矩阵的 OpenVLA×Spatial cell，完成 10 cells full data。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    trained_r2_image_mean_peak:\n      layer: L10\n      R2: 0.662\n    trained_r2_last_preaction_peak:\n      layer: L14\n      R2: 0.67\n    trained_r2_last_preaction_exit_L31: 0.54\n    trained_exit_collapse_delta: 0.13\n    untrained_r2_image_mean_peak:\n      layer: L13\n      R2: 0.848\n    untrained_r2_image_mean_exit_L31: 0.836\n    untrained_r2_last_preaction_peak:\n      layer: L22\n      R2: 0.828\n    untrained_r2_last_preaction_exit_L31: 0.812\n    untrained_exit_collapse_delta: 0.016\n    trained_L1_instruction_dominant: 24\n    trained_L1_total_heads: 32\n    untrained_L1_instruction_dominant: 25\n    untrained_L1_total_heads: 32\n    trained_image_mean_all_layers: 0.1\n    trained_last_preaction_L1: 0.989\n    trained_last_preaction_L2_plus: 1.0\n    untrained_last_preaction_all_layers: 1.0\n    trained_rsa_peak:\n      layer: L14\n      rsa: 0.69\n    untrained_rsa_peak:\n      layer: L13\n      rsa: 0.52\n    trained_cf_empty_d: 0.94\n    trained_cf_wrong_d: 0.85\n    trained_cf_shuffled_d: 0.83\n    trained_cf_paraphrased_d: 0.81\n    untrained_cf_empty_d: 1.02\n    untrained_cf_wrong_d: 0.82\n    untrained_cf_shuffled_d: 0.61\n    untrained_cf_paraphrased_d: 0.59\n  result_rationale: '**R² Exit Collapse (trained Δ=0.130 >> untrained Δ=0.016)**:\n\n    Spatial suite 确认 exit collapse，Δ=0.130 > 0.08 threshold。比 Goal（Δ=0.150）\n\n    稍低，与 OpenVLA Object（Δ=0.121）更接近——Spatial 和 Object 都是操作性任务，\n\n    instruction routing 需求类似。Untrained (OXE) 保持 flat profile（Δ=0.016），\n\n    与 Long suite（Δ=0.016）一致，进一步确认 OXE 通用训练不产生 exit collapse。\n\n\n    OXE model 的 R² 绝对值在 Spatial 上略低于 Long（image_mean peak 0.848 vs 0.848\n\n    几乎相同），这合理因为 OXE 训练包含多种 embodiment/task，Spatial manipulation\n\n    tasks 在 OXE 训练集中有 reasonable coverage。\n\n\n    **L1 Attention**: 与 Goal cell 一致（24/32 trained, 25/32 OXE），因为 L1 routing\n\n    由 model weights 决定而非 input data。同一模型在不同 suite 上的 L1 pattern 应\n\n    高度一致。\n\n\n    **Cross-Instruction**: Trained L1 accuracy 0.989 略低于 Goal 的 0.996，可能因为\n\n    Spatial suite 的 instruction 之间 overlap 更大（多个 \"put X on Y\" 结构相似）。\n\n    L2+ 仍为 100%。OXE untrained 全层 100%。\n\n\n    **RSA**: Trained peak L14（0.69）与 plan_010 Spatial benchmark 数据（peak L14-15,\n\n    RSA≈0.69）高度一致。这不是巧合——相同任务、相同 model family（OpenVLA），\n\n    RSA profile 应该 reproducible。\n\n\n    **CF**: Trained CF d 值 0.81-0.94，四个条件间差距比 Goal 更紧凑。Spatial tasks\n\n    的 instruction 结构更同质化（\"pick and place\" variants），导致 wrong/shuffled/para\n\n    的 CF 效应差异缩小。Empty 仍最强因为完全移除 instruction 是最极端的 counterfactual。\n\n\n    **Matrix completion**: 此 cell 是第 10 个 full-data cell，完成 3×4 矩阵。\n\n    10/10 cells with data，9/10 confirm exit collapse（仅 OFT outlier 不确认）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'OpenVLA × Spatial: R² Exit Collapse'\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - R² Peak\n    - Peak Layer\n    - R² Exit (L31)\n    - Δ\n    - Collapse?\n    rows:\n    - - Trained (Spatial-finetuned)\n      - '0.670'\n      - L14\n      - '0.540'\n      - '0.130'\n      - Yes (> 0.08)\n    - - Untrained (OXE pretrained)\n      - '0.828'\n      - L22\n      - '0.812'\n      - '0.016'\n      - 'No'\n  - title: Complete 3×4 R² Exit Collapse Matrix (10 cells)\n    columns:\n    - Architecture\n    - Goal Δ\n    - Spatial Δ\n    - Object Δ\n    - Long Δ\n    rows:\n    - - OpenVLA (Llama-2-7B)\n      - 0.150 ✓\n      - 0.130 ✓\n      - 0.121 ✓\n      - 0.004 △ OFT\n    - - TracVLA (Phi-3-mini)\n      - 0.228 ✓\n      - 0.138 ✓\n      - 0.294 ✓\n      - 0.198 ✓\n    - - NORA (Qwen2.5-VL-3B)\n      - 0.691 ✓\n      - 0.302 ✓\n      - — (no ckpt)\n      - — (no ckpt)\n  figures_description:\n  - '10-cell heatmap: 3 arch × 4 suite，色深编码 Δ magnitude，OFT cell 灰色标注'\n  - 'Per-layer R² overlay: OpenVLA Goal + Spatial + Object + Long trained profiles'\n  analysis: '第 10 个 cell 完成。矩阵汇总：9/10 cells confirm exit collapse，mean Δ=0.226。\n\n    OpenVLA 三个 full-training suite（Goal/Spatial/Object）Δ 在 0.12-0.15 范围内一致。\n\n    NORA 最极端（0.30-0.69），TracVLA 中等（0.14-0.29）。跨架构 Δ 差异反映\n\n    backbone capacity 和 training recipe 差异，但 presence of collapse 是 universal。\n\n    '\n- name: Batch Untrained Counterfactual (Missing Matrix Cells)\n  plan_id: cf_batch_missing_v1\n  description: '批量补跑缺失的 untrained counterfactual cells：OpenVLA Object untrained (OXE),\n\n    TracVLA Spatial/Object untrained (Phi-3-Vision)。使用 cosine_dist 方法\n\n    （untrained VLM 无法生成有意义 actions，改用 hidden representation 距离）。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    openvla_object_untrained_empty_cos_dist: 0.085\n    openvla_object_untrained_wrong_cos_dist: 0.052\n    openvla_object_untrained_shuffled_cos_dist: 0.045\n    openvla_object_untrained_para_cos_dist: 0.025\n    openvla_object_untrained_ordering: empty > wrong > shuffled > para\n    tracvla_spatial_untrained_empty_cos_dist: 0.148\n    tracvla_spatial_untrained_shuffled_cos_dist: 0.078\n    tracvla_spatial_untrained_wrong_cos_dist: 0.018\n    tracvla_spatial_untrained_para_cos_dist: 0.005\n    tracvla_spatial_untrained_ordering: empty >> shuffled > wrong > para\n    tracvla_object_untrained_empty_cos_dist: 0.142\n    tracvla_object_untrained_shuffled_cos_dist: 0.072\n    tracvla_object_untrained_wrong_cos_dist: 0.015\n    tracvla_object_untrained_para_cos_dist: 0.004\n    tracvla_object_untrained_ordering: empty >> shuffled > wrong > para\n    method_note: cosine_dist (untrained) vs cohens_d (trained) — orderings comparable,\n      magnitudes not\n  result_rationale: '**OpenVLA Object untrained (OXE pretrained, Tier 2)**:\n\n    OXE 模型的 CF pattern 应与 Long suite（empty cos=0.085, wrong=0.052）高度一致，\n\n    因为同一模型。cos_dist 值反映 hidden representation 对 instruction 变化的响应。\n\n    OXE 的 970K 通用训练已创建 instruction-sensitive representations，所以 cos_dist\n\n    非零且有 ordering。Ordering (empty > wrong > shuffled > para) 与 trained 一致，\n\n    但 magnitude 小于 trained 的 Cohen''s d（方法差异 + 通用 vs task-specific routing）。\n\n\n    **TracVLA Spatial/Object untrained (Phi-3-Vision, Tier 1)**:\n\n    Phi-3-Vision 作为纯 VLM base，其 CF pattern 应与 Goal/Long untrained 一致\n\n    （cf_batch_part2_v1: goal empty cos=0.153, long empty cos=0.173）。Spatial（0.148）\n\n    和 Object（0.142）的 empty cos_dist 略低于 Long（0.173），因为 spatial/object\n\n    instruction 的语义差异小于 long-horizon tasks。\n\n\n    关键 pattern：Phi-3-Vision untrained 的 ordering 是 empty >> shuffled > wrong > para\n\n    （注意 shuffled > wrong，与 trained 的 wrong > shuffled 不同）。这是因为 VLM base\n\n    主要响应 surface-level token 变化（shuffled 改变所有 token 位置，wrong 保留相似\n\n    语法结构），而 trained model 响应 semantic 变化（wrong task 语义完全不同，比\n\n    shuffled 更极端）。这一 ordering difference 是 training-induced semantic sensitivity\n\n    的间接证据。\n\n\n    **Cross-Tier comparison**:\n\n    - Tier 1 (VLM): cos_dist 0.005-0.173，weak and position-dominated\n\n    - Tier 2 (OXE): cos_dist 0.025-0.085，moderate, ordering matches trained\n\n    - Tier 3 (task-specific): Cohen''s d 0.70-1.52，strong, semantic ordering\n\n    CF sensitivity 在三个 tier 间 monotonically 增强，支持 routing gradient 叙事。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Untrained CF: Cross-Architecture Comparison (cosine_dist)'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - Suite\n    - empty\n    - shuffled\n    - wrong\n    - para\n    - Tier\n    rows:\n    - - OXE (Llama-2)\n      - Object\n      - '0.085'\n      - '0.045'\n      - '0.052'\n      - '0.025'\n      - Tier 2\n    - - OXE (Llama-2)\n      - Long\n      - 0.085*\n      - —\n      - —\n      - —\n      - Tier 2 (ref)\n    - - Phi-3-Vision\n      - Spatial\n      - '0.148'\n      - '0.078'\n      - '0.018'\n      - '0.005'\n      - Tier 1\n    - - Phi-3-Vision\n      - Object\n      - '0.142'\n      - '0.072'\n      - '0.015'\n      - '0.004'\n      - Tier 1\n    - - Phi-3-Vision\n      - Goal\n      - 0.153*\n      - 0.084*\n      - 0.016*\n      - 0.004*\n      - Tier 1 (ref)\n    - - Phi-3-Vision\n      - Long\n      - 0.173*\n      - 0.120*\n      - 0.022*\n      - 0.007*\n      - Tier 1 (ref)\n    - - Qwen2.5-VL\n      - Goal\n      - 0.081*\n      - 0.033*\n      - 0.014*\n      - 0.004*\n      - Tier 1 (ref)\n  - title: Trained vs Untrained CF Ordering Comparison\n    columns:\n    - Condition\n    - 1st\n    - 2nd\n    - 3rd\n    - 4th\n    - Interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - Trained (all arch)\n      - empty\n      - wrong\n      - shuffled\n      - para\n      - semantic sensitivity\n    - - Untrained VLM (Phi-3/Qwen)\n      - empty\n      - shuffled\n      - wrong\n      - para\n      - positional sensitivity\n    - - Untrained OXE (Llama-2)\n      - empty\n      - wrong\n      - shuffled\n      - para\n      - partial semantic\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Grouped bar chart: 3 tiers × 4 CF conditions，showing sensitivity gradient'\n  - 'Ordering comparison diagram: arrows showing how CF ranking shifts with training\n    tier'\n  analysis: 'Batch CF 补全后，untrained CF data 覆盖全部活跃 matrix cells。\n\n    Tier 1→2→3 的 CF sensitivity monotonic 增强确认 routing gradient。\n\n    Trained 和 untrained 的 ordering difference（wrong vs shuffled 位置互换）\n\n    是 training-induced semantic sensitivity 的 indirect evidence。\n\n    '\n- name: D095 Cross-Architecture Consolidated Matrix Analysis\n  plan_id: d095_synthesis\n  description: '汇总全部 3 arch × 4 suite 矩阵数据，计算 aggregate metrics，\n\n    验证 best tier key indicators 全部达标。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    matrix_cells_with_full_data: 10\n    matrix_total_possible: 12\n    missing_cells: NORA Object, NORA Long (no finetuned checkpoints)\n    r2_collapse_confirmed_cells: 9\n    r2_collapse_rejected_cells: 1\n    r2_collapse_outlier: OpenVLA Long (OFT, Δ=0.004)\n    mean_trained_exit_delta: 0.226\n    median_trained_exit_delta: 0.168\n    trained_delta_range:\n    - 0.004\n    - 0.691\n    trained_delta_iqr:\n    - 0.128\n    - 0.296\n    mean_untrained_exit_delta: 0.032\n    cf_sensitivity_ratio_tracvla: 8.1\n    cf_sensitivity_ratio_nora: 12.3\n    cf_sensitivity_ratio_overall: 9.5\n    cf_empty_first_fraction: 11/12 trained settings\n    cross_arch_r2_peak_layer_std: 2.4\n    cross_arch_inverted_u_confirmed: 3/3 architectures\n    cross_arch_exit_collapse_confirmed: 3/3 architectures\n    openvla_L1_gradient: untrained 0/32 → OXE 25/32 → trained 24/32\n    tracvla_L1_trained: 27-30/32\n    tracvla_L1_untrained: 32/32 (Phi-3-Vision pre-existing)\n    nora_L1_trained: 12-13/16\n    nora_L1_untrained: 13-14/16 (Qwen2.5-VL pre-existing)\n    d090_conclusion: L1 is base-model-dependent, NOT training-induced\n    tier1_signature: no exit collapse, weak CF (cos < 0.2), L1 from LLM pretraining\n    tier2_signature: no exit collapse, strong CF (d ≈ 1.0), L1 from OXE pretraining\n    tier3_signature: exit collapse (Δ > 0.08), task-specific CF, L1 ≈ OXE level\n    expected_reviewer_avg_score:\n    - 5.5\n    - 7.0\n    accept_probability:\n    - 0.55\n    - 0.75\n  result_rationale: '**Matrix completeness (10/12)**: NORA 仅 Goal+Spatial 因为无 Object/Long\n    finetuned checkpoint\n\n    （D089 决定）。10 cells 覆盖 3 architectures × 至少 2 suites，足以 claim cross-architecture\n\n    generalization。12 cells 中 10 个 filled = 83% coverage，CoRL standard 下可接受。\n\n\n    **R² exit collapse (9/10 confirmed, mean Δ=0.226)**:\n\n    9 cells 确认 trained Δ > 0.08，mean Δ=0.226 落入 best tier [0.2, 0.35] 的下半段。\n\n    Median Δ=0.168 更保守但仍远超 untrained mean（0.032）。跨架构一致性：OpenVLA\n\n    （Δ=0.12-0.15, Llama-2），TracVLA（Δ=0.14-0.29, Phi-3），NORA（Δ=0.30-0.69, Qwen2.5-VL）。\n\n    NORA 最极端可能因 GQA 架构（16h/2kv）导致更尖锐的 routing 重塑。OFT outlier（Δ=0.004）\n\n    被 D091 解释为 parameter-efficient finetuning 特例：TracVLA Long trained（full finetuning）\n\n    在同一 suite 上 Δ=0.198，证明 Long suite 本身不是问题。\n\n\n    **CF sensitivity ratio (9.5×)**:\n\n    跨 VLM-base architectures，trained CF sensitivity / untrained CF sensitivity ≈ 7-12×。\n\n    TracVLA mean ratio = (1.52/0.153 + 1.33/0.180 + 1.21/0.185 + 1.47/0.173) / 4 ≈\n    8.1×。\n\n    NORA Goal: 训练后 cosine saturated to 1.0 vs untrained 0.081 → ratio 极端但 metric\n\n    ceiling 导致不可比。Excluding NORA saturation，overall ratio ≈ 8-10×，comfortably in [7,\n    12]。\n\n\n    **Cross-architecture R² peak layer std (2.4)**:\n\n    OpenVLA peak L8-L13（center ~L10），TracVLA peak L4-L22（center ~L14），\n\n    NORA peak L10。std(10, 14, 10) ≈ 1.9-2.4，在 [1.5, 3.0] 内。Peak layer 跨架构\n\n    一致性说明 mid-layer integration 是 architecture-independent phenomenon。\n\n\n    **D090 区分**:\n\n    L1 head count 清晰分为两类：(a) Training-induced = 0（TracVLA/NORA untrained 已有\n\n    strong L1），(b) Pre-existing = 高（来自 VLM/LLM 预训练）。只有 OpenVLA 的\n\n    untrained=random init 显示 L1=0，但这是因为 random init 无任何语言能力。OXE pretrained\n\n    OpenVLA 已有 25/32。论文明确 claim：R² exit collapse 和 CF sensitivity 是\n\n    architecture-independent training effects，L1 head count 不是。\n\n\n    **三层级梯度**:\n\n    Tier 1→2→3 在 exit collapse（无→无→有）、CF sensitivity（弱→强→强+task-specific）、\n\n    和 routing pattern（无→通用→task-specific）上形成 monotonic gradient。这不是\n\n    binary creation story 而是 progressive emergence + reshaping story——更 nuanced，\n\n    更符合 developmental/training dynamics 的实际过程。\n\n\n    **Paper strength assessment**:\n\n    三个贡献全部 land：(1) Framework validated on 3×4=10 cells，(2) exit collapse +\n\n    CF 作为 architecture-independent signatures 有 9/10 cells 支持，(3) 三层级梯度\n\n    是 genuine new finding with clear mechanistic interpretation。D090 区分增强而非\n\n    削弱可信度。Expected reviewer score 5.5-7.0 基于：strong methodology (+)，\n\n    comprehensive validation (+)，clear narrative (+)，no closed-loop evaluation (-)，\n\n    open-loop only (-)，representational analysis 在 robotics venue 的 novelty concern\n    (-)。\n\n    Accept probability 55-75% 考虑了 CoRL 的 acceptance rate (~30%) 和论文的相对强度。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: Complete R² Exit Collapse Matrix (Trained Δ = peak − exit)\n    columns:\n    - Architecture (Backbone)\n    - Goal\n    - Spatial\n    - Object\n    - Long\n    - Mean Δ\n    rows:\n    - - OpenVLA (Llama-2-7B, 32L, MHA)\n      - 0.150 ✓\n      - 0.130 ✓\n      - 0.121 ✓\n      - 0.004 △\n      - '0.101'\n    - - TracVLA (Phi-3-mini, 32L, MHA)\n      - 0.228 ✓\n      - 0.138 ✓\n      - 0.294 ✓\n      - 0.198 ✓\n      - '0.215'\n    - - NORA (Qwen2.5-VL-3B, 36L, GQA)\n      - 0.691 ✓\n      - 0.302 ✓\n      - —\n      - —\n      - '0.497'\n    - - Column Mean\n      - '0.356'\n      - '0.190'\n      - '0.208'\n      - '0.101'\n      - 0.226 overall\n  - title: L1 Instruction-Dominant Heads (D090 Separation)\n    columns:\n    - Architecture\n    - Trained\n    - Untrained\n    - Training-Induced?\n    - Source\n    rows:\n    - - OpenVLA (random init)\n      - 24/32\n      - 0/32\n      - Appears so\n      - No LLM pretraining\n    - - OpenVLA (OXE pretrained)\n      - 24/32\n      - 25/32\n      - 'No'\n      - OXE pretraining\n    - - TracVLA\n      - 27-30/32\n      - 32/32\n      - No (decreased)\n      - Phi-3-Vision pretraining\n    - - NORA\n      - 12-13/16\n      - 13-14/16\n      - No (stable)\n      - Qwen2.5-VL pretraining\n  - title: Three-Tier Routing Gradient\n    columns:\n    - Tier\n    - Representative\n    - R² Exit Collapse\n    - CF empty d/cos\n    - L1 Routing\n    - Interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - 'Tier 1: VLM base'\n      - Phi-3-Vision / Qwen2.5-VL\n      - None (Δ < 0.05)\n      - cos < 0.2\n      - From LLM pretrain\n      - No action routing\n    - - 'Tier 2: OXE VLA'\n      - openvla-7b (970K eps)\n      - None (Δ = 0.02)\n      - d ≈ 1.05\n      - 25/32 from OXE\n      - General routing\n    - - 'Tier 3: Task VLA'\n      - All 3 finetuned VLAs\n      - Yes (Δ = 0.12-0.69)\n      - d ≈ 0.7-1.5\n      - ≈ Tier 2 level\n      - Task-specific routing\n  - title: Best Tier Key Indicator Verification\n    columns:\n    - Indicator\n    - Target Range\n    - Predicted Value\n    - Status\n    rows:\n    - - r2_collapse_confirmed_cells\n      - '[9, 10]'\n      - '9'\n      - ✓ in range\n    - - mean_trained_exit_delta\n      - '[0.2, 0.35]'\n      - '0.226'\n      - ✓ in range\n    - - cf_sensitivity_ratio\n      - '[7, 12]'\n      - '9.5'\n      - ✓ in range\n    - - matrix_cells_with_full_data\n      - '[9, 10]'\n      - '10'\n      - ✓ in range\n    - - cross_arch_r2_peak_layer_std\n      - '[1.5, 3.0]'\n      - '2.4'\n      - ✓ in range\n    - - expected_reviewer_avg_score\n      - '[5.5, 7.0]'\n      - '6.2'\n      - ✓ in range\n    - - accept_probability\n      - '[0.55, 0.75]'\n      - '0.65'\n      - ✓ in range\n  figures_description:\n  - '3×4 heatmap matrix: exit collapse Δ，色深从白(0)到深红(0.7)，OFT cell 特殊标注'\n  - 'Three-tier gradient schematic: VLM→OXE→Task 的 routing evolution，标注 what emerges\n    vs what reshapes'\n  - 'Radar chart: 7 key indicators vs target ranges，显示 best tier alignment'\n  analysis: 'All 7 key indicators 落入 best tier target range。矩阵完整（10/12 cells），\n\n    cross-architecture exit collapse confirmed（9/10），三层级梯度 clean，\n\n    D090 区分增强 scientific rigor。论文 ready for CoRL submission at D095 strength。\n\n    主要 risk factors：(1) no closed-loop evaluation（-1 点 reviewer penalty），\n\n    (2) representational analysis 在 robotics venue 的 novelty perception，\n\n    (3) OFT outlier 的 explanation 是否被 accept。Best case: 6.2 avg score, 65% accept。'\n","numLines":1411,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1411}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RqwBsTnX1qvK6mTVASZa8o","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"CoRL 2026 reviewer guidelines review form\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"CoRL 2026 - Instruction for Authors\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-authors\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2026 Conference | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org%2FCoRL%2F2026%2FConference\"},{\"title\":\"Reviewer Guidelines — CoRL 2023\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl2023.org/reviewer-guidelines\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2026 - Call for Papers\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl.org/contributions/call-for-papers\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2026\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl.org/\"},{\"title\":\"ICLR 2026 Reviewer Guide\",\"url\":\"https://iclr.cc/Conferences/2026/ReviewerGuide\"},{\"title\":\"Robot Learning Foundation\",\"url\":\"https://www.robot-learning.org/\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 - Instruction for Reviews\",\"url\":\"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-reviews\"},{\"title\":\"Instructions for Reviewers\",\"url\":\"https://corl2022.org/instructions-for-reviewers/\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2025 Conference | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org%2FCoRL%2F2025%2FConference\"}]\n\nBased on my search results, I found information about CoRL 2026, but the specific reviewer guidelines and review form document was not directly available in the search results. Here's what I found:\n\n## CoRL 2026 Information\n\nCoRL aims to have at least two reviewers per paper. All submissions must include at least one author who agrees to serve as a CoRL reviewer, and they are qualified if they have at least one accepted publication at a previous robotics (CoRL/ICRA/IROS/RSS) or learning conference (ICLR/NeurIPS/ICML) or equivalent journal.\n\nThe search results also reference reviewer guidelines from CoRL 2023, which emphasize that reviewers should generally be constructive and concrete; be courteous and respectful, and start with the positive aspects and suggest improvements.\n\n## Where to Find the Full Guidelines\n\nFor the complete CoRL 2026 reviewer guidelines and review form, you would likely need to:\n\n1. Check the official CoRL 2026 website at corl.org\n2. Access the OpenReview page for CoRL 2026 (https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org/CoRL/2026/Conference)\n3. Contact the CoRL 2026 organizers directly\n\nThe search results did not contain a dedicated \"reviewer guidelines\" page specific to CoRL 2026 like the one that exists for previous years' conferences.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6f46fab0-1092-4dec-b5ea-345cef574fce","uuid":"0a698bb4-1351-4b90-9d53-730a2119d121","timestamp":"2026-05-22T03:12:26.958Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"CoRL 2026 reviewer guidelines review form","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01HM7TVNxJi5rqfdVTrVA2jv","content":[{"title":"CoRL 2026 - Instruction for Authors","url":"https://www.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-authors"},{"title":"CoRL 2026 Conference | OpenReview","url":"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org%2FCoRL%2F2026%2FConference"},{"title":"Reviewer Guidelines — CoRL 2023","url":"https://www.corl2023.org/reviewer-guidelines"},{"title":"CoRL 2026 - Call for Papers","url":"https://www.corl.org/contributions/call-for-papers"},{"title":"CoRL 2026","url":"https://www.corl.org/"},{"title":"ICLR 2026 Reviewer Guide","url":"https://iclr.cc/Conferences/2026/ReviewerGuide"},{"title":"Robot Learning Foundation","url":"https://www.robot-learning.org/"},{"title":"CoRL 2024 - Instruction for Reviews","url":"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-reviews"},{"title":"Instructions for Reviewers","url":"https://corl2022.org/instructions-for-reviewers/"},{"title":"CoRL 2025 Conference | OpenReview","url":"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org%2FCoRL%2F2025%2FConference"}]},"Based on my search results, I found information about CoRL 2026, but the specific reviewer guidelines and review form document was not directly available in the search results. Here's what I found:\n\n## CoRL 2026 Information\n\nCoRL aims to have at least two reviewers per paper. All submissions must include at least one author who agrees to serve as a CoRL reviewer, and they are qualified if they have at least one accepted publication at a previous robotics (CoRL/ICRA/IROS/RSS) or learning conference (ICLR/NeurIPS/ICML) or equivalent journal.\n\nThe search results also reference reviewer guidelines from CoRL 2023, which emphasize that reviewers should generally be constructive and concrete; be courteous and respectful, and start with the positive aspects and suggest improvements.\n\n## Where to Find the Full Guidelines\n\nFor the complete CoRL 2026 reviewer guidelines and review form, you would likely need to:\n\n1. Check the official CoRL 2026 website at corl.org\n2. Access the OpenReview page for CoRL 2026 (https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org/CoRL/2026/Conference)\n3. Contact the CoRL 2026 organizers directly\n\nThe search results did not contain a dedicated \"reviewer guidelines\" page specific to CoRL 2026 like the one that exists for previous years' conferences."],"durationSeconds":5.68892762}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018GjG25RfdxtY5qodeDmDL1","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"CoRL 2025 reviewer guidelines scoring criteria review form\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Reviewer Guidelines — CoRL 2023\",\"url\":\"https://www.corl2023.org/reviewer-guidelines\"},{\"title\":\"ICLR 2025 Reviewer Guide\",\"url\":\"https://iclr.cc/Conferences/2025/ReviewerGuide\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2024 - Instruction for Reviews\",\"url\":\"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-reviews\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2025 Conference | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org%2FCoRL%2F2025%2FConference\"},{\"title\":\"ARR Area Chair Guidelines – ACL Rolling Review – A peer review platform for the Association for Computational Linguistics\",\"url\":\"http://aclrollingreview.org/acguidelines\"},{\"title\":\"Thank you to our 2025 reviewers\",\"url\":\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC12921489/\"},{\"title\":\"CoRL 2025 Demos | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org%2FCoRL%2F2025%2FDemos\"},{\"title\":\"Reviewers in 2024\",\"url\":\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC12056528/\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found information about CoRL reviewer guidelines, though the most specific results were for CoRL 2024 rather than 2025. Here's what I found:\n\n## CoRL 2024 Review Criteria\n\nSubmissions are evaluated based on the significance and novelty of the results, either theoretical or empirical.\n\n## Key Reviewer Guidelines\n\nThe general CoRL reviewer guidelines emphasize several important principles:\n\n- CoRL papers are required to include a limitations section.\n- Honestly reported limitations should be treated kindly, while obvious shortcomings or flaws not reported by the authors should be pointed out extensively and strongly reflected in scores.\n- Reviewers should be constructive and concrete; be courteous and respectful.\n\n## Desk Rejection Criteria\n\nPapers can be desk rejected for formatting issues, anonymity violation, or scope. All CoRL submissions must demonstrate relevance to Robot Learning through explicitly addressing a learning question for physical robots OR testing the proposed learning solution on physical robots.\n\nThe OpenReview page for CoRL 2025 is available, but the specific 2025 reviewer guidelines and scoring form details don't appear to be fully detailed in these search results. For the most current and complete information, I'd recommend visiting the official CoRL 2025 OpenReview conference page directly.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6f46fab0-1092-4dec-b5ea-345cef574fce","uuid":"1a14bb84-6b3f-4b2f-93f8-b74b0eedc140","timestamp":"2026-05-22T03:12:29.388Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"CoRL 2025 reviewer guidelines scoring criteria review form","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_016ixE7GBSLPvNCFwpXsoYZU","content":[{"title":"Reviewer Guidelines — CoRL 2023","url":"https://www.corl2023.org/reviewer-guidelines"},{"title":"ICLR 2025 Reviewer Guide","url":"https://iclr.cc/Conferences/2025/ReviewerGuide"},{"title":"CoRL 2024 - Instruction for Reviews","url":"https://2024.corl.org/contributions/instruction-for-reviews"},{"title":"CoRL 2025 Conference | OpenReview","url":"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org%2FCoRL%2F2025%2FConference"},{"title":"ARR Area Chair Guidelines – ACL Rolling Review – A peer review platform for the Association for Computational Linguistics","url":"http://aclrollingreview.org/acguidelines"},{"title":"Thank you to our 2025 reviewers","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC12921489/"},{"title":"CoRL 2025 Demos | OpenReview","url":"https://openreview.net/group?id=robot-learning.org%2FCoRL%2F2025%2FDemos"},{"title":"Reviewers in 2024","url":"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC12056528/"}]},"Based on the search results, I found information about CoRL reviewer guidelines, though the most specific results were for CoRL 2024 rather than 2025. Here's what I found:\n\n## CoRL 2024 Review Criteria\n\nSubmissions are evaluated based on the significance and novelty of the results, either theoretical or empirical.\n\n## Key Reviewer Guidelines\n\nThe general CoRL reviewer guidelines emphasize several important principles:\n\n- CoRL papers are required to include a limitations section.\n- Honestly reported limitations should be treated kindly, while obvious shortcomings or flaws not reported by the authors should be pointed out extensively and strongly reflected in scores.\n- Reviewers should be constructive and concrete; be courteous and respectful.\n\n## Desk Rejection Criteria\n\nPapers can be desk rejected for formatting issues, anonymity violation, or scope. All CoRL submissions must demonstrate relevance to Robot Learning through explicitly addressing a learning question for physical robots OR testing the proposed learning solution on physical robots.\n\nThe OpenReview page for CoRL 2025 is available, but the specific 2025 reviewer guidelines and scoring form details don't appear to be fully detailed in these search results. For the most current and complete information, I'd recommend visiting the official CoRL 2025 OpenReview conference page directly."],"durationSeconds":7.198070500999998}}
