{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015iXYC6CJ8egLGi98HGggWZ","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/projects/vla-ssd/memory.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# VLA-SSD Project Memory\\\\n\\\\n## ⚠️ Untrained Baseline 定义澄清 (2026-05-21)\\\\n\\\\n**\\\\\\\"OpenVLA base LLM = 0/32\\\\\\\" 标注有误。** 0/32 来自 random init，不是 Llama-2 base。\\\\n\\\\n### OpenVLA Goal 三条件梯度（实际数据）\\\\n| 条件 | Checkpoint | L1 instruction-dominant |\\\\n|------|-----------|------------------------|\\\\n| random init | 随机初始化权重 | **0/32** |\\\\n| Llama-2-7b-hf base | meta-llama/Llama-2-7b-hf | **~9/32** |\\\\n| OXE pretrained (openvla-7b) | openvla-7b | **~24/32** |\\\\n| LIBERO finetuned | openvla-7b-finetuned | **24-26/32** |\\\\n\\\\n### 各架构 \\\\\\\"untrained\\\\\\\" baseline 实际模型\\\\n| 架构 | \\\\\\\"Untrained\\\\\\\" 模型 | 性质 | 已见 action data? |\\\\n|------|-----------------|------|-----------------|\\\\n| OpenVLA | openvla-7b | OXE 预训练 VLA | ✅ 970K+ 轨迹 |\\\\n| TraceVLA | phi3v-base (Phi-3-Vision) | 纯 VLM | ❌ |\\\\n| NORA | qwen25-vl-3b-base | 纯 VLM | ❌ |\\\\n\\\\n三架构 \\\\\\\"untrained\\\\\\\" 语义不一致。OpenVLA 的是 pre-VLA，其他两个是 pre-VLM。\\\\n\\\\n## OpenVLA Long Untrained: OXE Pretraining Already Creates Routing (2026-05-21)\\\\n\\\\n**关键负向结果**：openvla_long_untrained_v1 证伪\\\\\\\"untrained 缺乏 routing\\\\\\\"假设。\\\\n\\\\n| Metric | OFT trained | OXE untrained | 含义 |\\\\n|--------|------------|---------------|------|\\\\n| L1 instr-dom | 14/32 | 25/32 | OXE 更偏极化，fine-tuning 增加 mixed |\\\\n| CF empty d | 0.505 | 1.048 | untrained 2x 更敏感 |\\\\n| R² collapse | 无 | 无 | Long suite 两条件一致无 collapse |\\\\n\\\\n**解读**：OXE pretraining 已创建强 routing。LIBERO fine-tuning 是 **reshaping**（增加 mixed heads、降低 CF 敏感性）而非 **creating**。这与 TracVLA/NORA untrained（纯 VLM，无任何 routing）形成对比。\\\\n\\\\n**论文影响**：不需要大改 framing，但需在 Discussion 中区分：\\\\n- \\\\\\\"routing emergence\\\\\\\" (VLM→VLA, 跨架构一致, 主要 claim)\\\\n- \\\\\\\"routing reshaping\\\\\\\" (OXE→LIBERO, OpenVLA 特有)\\\\n\\\\n## D090: Training-induced vs Base-model-dependent 效应区分 (2026-05-21)\\\\n\\\\nDirector 决策：论文需区分两类效应，**不需要大改 framing，但需细化**。\\\\n\\\\n### Training-induced (architecture-independent) — 可 claim\\\\n- **R² exit collapse**: 三架构一致，trained 有、untrained 无\\\\n- **Counterfactual sensitivity**: trained model 对指令替换敏感\\\\n\\\\n### Base-model-dependent (NOT training-induced) — 不可 claim 为训练效果\\\\n- **L1 instruction dominance**: VLM base 已有强 L1 routing（TracVLA untrained 32/32，trained 30/32）\\\\n- **Cross-instruction classification**: 预训练模型已能完美区分指令（两条件都 1.0）\\\\n- OpenVLA 的 L1 梯度（0→9→24）是特例，因 base LLM 没有视觉能力\\\\n\\\\n### 精确贡献定位\\\\n\\\\\\\"VLA 训练学到什么\\\\\\\" vs \\\\\\\"从 base model 继承什么\\\\\\\" — 这是更精确的科学贡献。\\\\n\\\\n## TracVLA 4-Suite Trained Consistency — h13/h22 Universal Mixed Heads (2026-05-21)\\\\n\\\\nTraceVLA (Phi-3-mini) 跨全部 4 个 LIBERO suite 的 trained 结果：\\\\n\\\\n| Suite | L1 instr-dom | Mixed heads | CF ordering | R² exit (last_preaction) |\\\\n|-------|-------------|-------------|-------------|--------------------------|\\\\n| Goal | 27/32 | h2,h6,**h13**,**h22**,h24 | empty>wrong>shuffled>para ✓ | 0.802→0.307 (L18→L30) |\\\\n| Spatial | ~30/32 | **h13**,**h22** | ✓ | ✓ |\\\\n| Object | ~30/32 | **h13**,**h22** | ✓ | ✓ |\\\\n| Long | 30/32 | **h13**,**h22** | ✓ | 0.817→0.434 (L11→L30) |\\\\n\\\\n**关键发现**：\\\\n- h13/h22 是跨 suite 完全一致的 universal mixed heads\\\\n- Untrained (Phi-3-Vision base) 在全部 4 suites 均显示 32/32 uniform + flat R² + 无 mixed heads → pattern 完全是 training-induced\\\\n- TracVLA untrained CF: pipeline 跳过（纯 VLM 无法生成动作）。用 counterfactual_batch.py 的 cosine_dist 方法补跑\\\\n\\\\n## D089: NORA 矩阵范围 (2026-05-21)\\\\n\\\\nNORA 只有 Goal + Spatial checkpoint，**Object/Long 放弃**。3×4 矩阵变为：\\\\n- OpenVLA: 4 suites (Goal, Spatial, Object, Long)\\\\n- TraceVLA: 4 suites (单一 checkpoint 覆盖全部)\\\\n- NORA: 2 suites (Goal, Spatial)\\\\n\\\\n## OFT Checkpoint 特殊行为 (2026-05-21)\\\\n\\\\n**OFT (Orthogonal Fine-Tuning) ≠ 标准微调**：\\\\n- 标准微调：更新 config.json 中的 norm_stats（包含新 dataset key）\\\\n- OFT 微调：**不更新** config.json（保留 OXE keys），将微调数据统计单独存在 `dataset_statistics.json`（key = `libero_10_no_noops`）\\\\n- 修复：加载后合并 dataset_statistics.json 到 model.norm_stats\\\\n\\\\n## OpenVLA Long L1 = 14/32 (2026-05-21)\\\\n\\\\nCheckpoint 确认正确（OFT）。14/32 是真实的 Long-specific 结果，不是 checkpoint 错误。\\\\nOFT fine-tuning 创建了更多 mixed heads (17/32)，与标准微调的 24-26/32 instr-dom 形成对比。\\\\n\\\\n## NORA Goal: Third Architecture Confirms Convergent Routing (2026-05-21)\\\\n\\\\n### 三模型 Exit Layer Collapse 确认\\\\nNORA (Qwen2.5-VL-3B, 36 layers, GQA 16h/2kv) 在 LIBERO-Goal 上展现与 OpenVLA (Llama-2) / TraceVLA (Phi-3) 一致的 convergent routing pattern：\\\\n- **R² collapse**: L10 peak=0.697 → L35=-0.004（trained），untrained L35=0.656（无崩塌）\\\\n- **Cross-instruction L35**: trained=0.085 (≈chance)，untrained=0.990\\\\n- **Counterfactual L35**: cosine distance=1.0（所有条件表征相同）\\\\n- **L1 attention**: 13/16 instruction-dominant（但 trained/untrained 分布一致——GQA 特性）\\\\n\\\\n## NORA Spatial Results (2026-05-21)\\\\n\\\\n### R² Probing\\\\n- **Trained**: last_pre peak L24=0.720, exit L35=0.417 (collapse ✓)\\\\n- **Untrained**: last_pre peak L8=0.632, exit L35=0.596 (no collapse ✓)\\\\n\\\\n### Counterfactual (trained, L35)\\\\nwrong cos_dist=0.275, empty=0.238, shuffled=0.114, paraphrased=0.023\\\\n\\\\n## OpenVLA Object Results (2026-05-21)\\\\n\\\\n### Trained\\\\n- R² probing: img_mean peak L12=0.807, last_pre peak L13=0.787, exit L31=0.666\\\\n- L1 attention: 24/32 instruction-dominant\\\\n- Counterfactual: empty d=1.212, wrong d=1.188, shuffled d=1.122, paraphrased d=0.896\\\\n\\\\n### Untrained (openvla-7b, Phase 1-5 only, Phase 6 crash)\\\\n- R² probing: last_pre peak L19=0.761, exit L31=0.685\\\\n- L1 attention: 24/32 (same as trained — because openvla-7b already VLA-pretrained)\\\\n- Counterfactual: MISSING → cf_batch_missing_v1 补跑中\\\\n\\\\n## 操作教训 (2026-05-21)\\\\n\\\\n### M015: submit 后必须 2 分钟内验证启动\\\\nsubmit_training_job 后立即派 Worker 检查日志前几行。不依赖 cron 延迟发现。\\\\n\\\\n### M015: argparse --conditions 统一格式\\\\n所有 pipeline 脚本必须用 `nargs='+'` + `choices=['trained','untrained']`。全部 7 个脚本已审计修复。\\\\n\\\\n## Ridge vs MLP Probing Decision (2026-05-21)\\\\nMLP 118min/层 → Ridge 秒级。所有 pipeline 已切换。\\\\n\\\\n## Streaming Attention Fix (2026-05-21)\\\\nPhase 1 存 5000 个 attention 矩阵 ~50GB → streaming 即时计算 <1KB。\\\\n\\\\n## AutoDL 环境经验 (2026-05-21)\\\\n- OpenVLA processor auto_map 指向 HF repo → 改本地路径\\\\n- ModelScope CDN >> HF 代理\\\\n- NORA 需独立 venv (transformers=4.50.0)\\\\n- submit_training_job 用 tmux，不怕 SSH 断连\\\\n- CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES 自动映射，脚本内用 cuda:0\\\\n\\\\n## TraceVLA-Phi3V Checkpoint Info (2026-05-19)\\\\n- 服务器: westd-19183, 路径: `/root/autodl-tmp/vla-ssd/checkpoints/tracevla-phi3v/`\\\\n- 来源: HuggingFace `trace-ai/tracevla-phi3v`\\\\n- 架构: Phi-3-mini, 32 layers, hidden=3072\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 5860, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_015aqnmHzHu27rYALNnjZ4kn","session_id":"6f46fab0-1092-4dec-b5ea-345cef574fce","uuid":"4e3e168c-4640-4853-93a4-75e15abec126","timestamp":"2026-05-22T03:15:00.076Z"}
