{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FqDLPYD6ncpaiWAPzsWRo8","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/projects/vla-ssd/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-22\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\\\\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\\\\n| openvla_spatial_standardized_v1 | OpenVLA (Llama-2-7B backbone) on LIBERO-Spatial standardized 5-phase pipeline (R² probing, L1 attention, cross-instruction classification, RSA, counterfactual). Both trained and untrained conditions. Filling missing R² exit, L1 attention, and untrained CF data for Spatial cell. Expect similar patterns to Goal/Object: R² exit collapse in trained, instruction-dominant L1 heads. | — | — | — |\\\\n| openvla_goal_standardized_v1 | OpenVLA (Llama-2-7B backbone) on LIBERO-Goal standardized 5-phase pipeline (R² probing, L1 attention, cross-instruction, RSA, counterfactual). Both trained (openvla-7b-finetuned-libero-goal) and untrained (openvla-7b OXE pretrained) conditions. Replaces earlier incomplete Goal data that lacked R² probing and untrained arm. | — | — | — |\\\\n| cf_batch_missing_v1 | Batch counterfactual补跑：filling missing untrained CF cells in 3×4 matrix using cosine_dist method. Covers: openvla object untrained, tracvla spatial/object/goal/long untrained. cosine_dist compares hidden representation distances (not action outputs), works for pure VLM bases that cannot generate meaningful actions. | — | — | — |\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n- tracvla_spatial_full_v2: TraceVLA (Phi-3-mini) on LIBERO-Spatial shows the convergent entry-exit routing pattern when fine-tuned, and the untrained base model (Phi-3-Vision) lacks this pattern. Cross-suite validation for second architecture.（已分配 ? GPU:?，等待提交）\\\\n- behavioral_smoketest_diag（准备中）\\\\n- behavioral_pilot_v2: Ablating L1 instruction-dominant heads (24/32) during VLA inference on LIBERO-Goal fine-tuned OpenVLA reduces task success rate, providing behavioral evidence that attention head specialization has functional consequences for task execution.（准备中）\\\\n- behavioral_pilot: Ablating L1 instruction-dominant heads during VLA inference will measurably change task success rate, providing behavioral evidence that these heads serve a functional role beyond representational reorganization measured by probes.（准备中）\\\\n- tracvla_spatial_trained（准备中）\\\\n- libero_finetuned_probe（准备中）\\\\n- fulllayer_action_probe（准备中）\\\\n- l1_head_ablation_control8（准备中）\\\\n- l1_head_ablation_50demos（准备中）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **cf_batch_part2_v1** (success): TracVLA (Phi-3-Vision base, untrained) counterfactual sensitivity using cosine_dist on LIBERO-Goal and LIBERO-Long. Tests whether untrained model shows different CF ordering than trained model, providing the untrained control arm for trained vs untrained CF comparison.\\\\n  [cf_batch_part2_v1_analysis](/api/workspace-files/projects/vla-ssd/artifacts/cf_batch_part2_v1/report/cf_batch_part2_v1_analysis.md)\\\\n- **openvla_long_cf_trained** (success): OpenVLA Long (OFT fine-tuned) trained counterfactual sensitivity — completing the missing CF phase from openvla_long_pipeline_v1 after unnorm_key bug fix. Tests whether counterfactual ordering (empty>wrong>shuffled>para) holds for Long suite as seen in Goal/Spatial/Object. ← 基于 openvla_long_pipeline_v1\\\\n- **openvla_long_untrained_v1** (success): OpenVLA (openvla-7b, OXE pretrained but not LIBERO fine-tuned) untrained baseline on LIBERO-Long — full 5-phase pipeline. Tests whether the convergent routing pattern (R² exit collapse, L1 mixed heads, counterfactual sensitivity) is absent in the OXE-pretrained base. Note: openvla-7b is not a raw LLM — it has seen 970K+ action trajectories from OXE pretraining. ← 基于 openvla_long_pipeline_v1\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 100 / 负向 17 / 失败 5 / 共 134\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nwestd-19183: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- mvp2_action_probe: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- lg_extract_trained_r2: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- lg_extract_untrained_r2: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- lg_extract_trained_r1: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- lg_extract_untrained_r1: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- lg_shuffled_token_control: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- lg_instruction_ablation: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- lg_output_head_analysis: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- threecond_multiseed_r2: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- behavioral_pilot_w4: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- libero_object_full_pipeline: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- tracvla_spatial_pipeline: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- nora_goal_full_pipeline: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- nora_goal_pipeline_v2: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- object_pipeline_ridge: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- nora_spatial_pipeline_v1: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- openvla_long_pipeline_v1: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 4330, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01GSaeh7u7f7cfcCBAsXc3Yz","session_id":"6f46fab0-1092-4dec-b5ea-345cef574fce","uuid":"1cbddb82-8bd6-4219-a108-6d5a5b58ba12","timestamp":"2026-05-22T03:17:46.408Z"}
